(2651, 'FIXED HEAD SPIRAL MIXER-IM53T', NULL, 'fixed-head-spiral-mixer-im53t-1', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Fixed Head Spiral Mixer</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Bowl volume: 53 ltr</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Dough Capacity: 44 kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Power/voltage: 400V/ 50 Hz</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Absorption: 2 hp / 3 PHASE</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Weight: 110 kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ External dim: 530*860*720 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ IM 53T/ GGF s.r.l./ italy made</p>', NULL, 'The FIXED HEAD SPIRAL MIXER-IM53T is a versatile and robust dough mixer designed for commercial baking applications. Featuring a fixed head and spiral mixing mechanism, it ensures efficient and uniform dough mixing, making it perfect for handling large volumes of dough. The IM53T model boasts a powerful motor and durable construction, offering reliable performance for busy kitchens and bakeries. Its user-friendly controls and high-capacity bowl make it an excellent choice for producing consistent and high-quality dough with ease.', NULL, '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Fixed Head Spiral Mixer</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Bowl volume: 53 ltr</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Dough Capacity: 44 kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Power/voltage: 400V/ 50 Hz</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Absorption: 2 hp / 3 PHASE</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Weight: 110 kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ External dim: 530*860*720 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ IM 53T/ GGF s.r.l./ italy made</p>', 6739.92, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 77, NULL, NULL, 15, NULL, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, 'active', 'Bakery Mixers', NULL, 'IM53T', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-