(2899, 'HOT BANQUET TROLLEY  EMP.BQ2', NULL, 'hot-banquet-trolley-empbq2-1', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ HOT BANQUET TROLLEY EMP.BQ2</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ scap: 2 x 11 x GN2/1 size</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ system with humidity</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ 2 sides handles</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Magnetic locker</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ temp: 30 ~ 85 Â°c</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ digital control</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ structure: stainless steel</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Voltage: 220 - 240 v / 50 hz</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Power: 3.4 kw</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ weight: 200 kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ 2 wheels w/ breaks</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ dim: 1352 x 888 x 1803 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ EMP.BQ2 / EMPERO turkey made</p>', NULL, 'The EMP.BQ2 Hot Banquet Trolley is an essential piece of equipment for catering and hospitality services, designed to keep food warm and ready for service. This trolley features a robust construction with insulated compartments, ensuring optimal temperature retention for extended periods. It is equipped with multiple shelves to accommodate a variety of dishes, making it ideal for large events and banquets. The trolley is easy to maneuver, thanks to its swivel casters and ergonomic handles, allowing for smooth and efficient transport of meals. With its reliable heating system and spacious design, the EMP.BQ2 ensures that food remains at the perfect serving temperature, enhancing the dining experience for guests.', NULL, '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ HOT BANQUET TROLLEY EMP.BQ2</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ scap: 2 x 11 x GN2/