(2947, 'CONVEYOR TOASTER-TQ10', NULL, 'conveyor-toaster-tq10-1', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ 4-position toast selector switch</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ off / toast / buns / stand-by mode</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ 89 mm 3Â½\") clearance to accommodate</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ high profile bread products</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Easy-to-load rack w/ front or rea discharging</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Permanently lubricated 50/60 Hz motor</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ V-shaped reflectors help capture &amp; redirect heat</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Long lasting serpentine metal sheathed</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ heating elements</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ 102 mm (4\") adjustable legs</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Pilot light that signals unit is in operation</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Discharge and crumb trays are removable\r\\nfor easy cleaning</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Amps: 8.8-9.6</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Power:220-240/ 1940-2300/ 50-60HZ</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Dim: 368 W x 419 D x 387 H mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ TQ10/ HATCO / USA made</p>', NULL, 'The TQ10 Conveyor Toaster is a sleek and efficient kitchen appliance designed to make your toasting process a breeze. With its stainless steel construction, it not only adds a touch of modernity to your kitchen but also ensures durability and easy maintenance.\r\\n\r\\nThis toaster is equipped with a conveyor belt system that allows for a continuous toasting process, making it ideal for busy kitchens or breakfast buffets. The adjustable conveyor speed gives you control over the toasting time, allowing you to achieve th