in: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Dim: 368 W x 419 D x 387 H mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ TQ10/ HATCO / USA made</p>', 4200.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 17, 26, 27, 24, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Sandwich Maker', NULL, 'TQ10', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:09', '2026-04-18 14:51:30', NULL, 0),
