ity</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Even heat distribution - no cold spots</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Reflector does not blacken, maintains a consistent heat pattern</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Reinforced wire guard provides operator safety</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Pre-focused heat pattern</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Amps: 11.7 Amps</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Power wattage: 1,400Watts/ 220V / 50/60hz</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Dim: 1524 x 152 x 165 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ GRAH-60 / HATCO / USA made</p>', 2307.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 107, 108, NULL, 24, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Food Warmers', NULL, 'GRAH-60', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:09', '2026-04-18 14:51:30', NULL, 0);
