(3357, 'Espresso cappuccino machine ELEG2AT3N20', NULL, 'espresso-cappuccino-machine-eleg2at3n20-1', '<p style=\"text-align: left;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0px\">â€¢ Espresso cappuccino machine</p>\r\\n<p style=\"text-align: left;margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ 2 group / ELEGANCE AUTOMATIC</p>\r\\n<p style=\"text-align: left;margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ boiler capacity: 13.5 lt / / color: BLACK</p>\r\\n<p style=\"text-align: left;margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Automatic coffee and hot water portion control</p>\r\\n<p style=\"text-align: left;margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ W/ display to view alarms, drinks &amp; operative funcions</p>\r\\n<p style=\"text-align: left;margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Painted iron side/back panel (WHITE or MATT BLACK) w/ stainless\r\\nsteel finishes</p>\r\\n<p style=\"text-align: left;margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Stainless steel steam and water wands</p>\r\\n<p style=\"text-align: left;margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Coffee pre-infusionsystem and thermosiphon system</p>\r\\n<p style=\"text-align: left;margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Copper boiler (Cu 99,5) with anti-oxidation treatment</p>\r\\n<p style=\"text-align: left;margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Weight : 70 kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\"text-align: left;margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ thermal power : 3000 watt</p>\r\\n<p style=\"text-align: left;margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ voltz : 220-240 V / 1 N / 50-60 hz</p>\r\\n<p style=\"text-align: left;margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Dim: 795 x 575 x 560 ( w+d+h)</p>\r\\n<p style=\"text-align: left;margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Model: ELEG2AT3N20/ SAB ESPRESSO/ italy made</p>', NULL, 'The ELEG2AT3N20 Espresso Cappuccino Machine is a sophisticated and versatile appliance designed for espresso and cappuccino aficionados. With its elegant design and advanced features, it offers precise control over the brewing process, ensuring consistently rich and flavorful espresso and creamy cappuccino. Its user-friendly interface and high-quality construction