(3646, 'Cheese Grater- 02A', NULL, 'cheese-grater-02a-2', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0px\">â€¢ Grater- 02A (1 standard disc)</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Average output: 50kg/hour</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ A wide range of discs is available to grate hard and soft cheese, chocolate, peanuts and dried fruits</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Its new design facilitates cleaning and maintenance (removable housing and disc)</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Safety switch: the machine stops when opening the drawer or lever</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Delivered with 1 standard disc with Ã¸ 3 mm holes (other discs available on demand)</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Power: 220 - 240 V - 50/60 Hz - 230 W</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Speed: 1500 rpm (50 Hz) ~ 1800 rpm (60 Hz)</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Weight: Net: 14,5 kg (32 lbs) ~ Packed: 15,6 kg (34 lbs)</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Dim: 420 x 250 x 350 mm (D x W x H)</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Model: 02A / SANTOS / FRANCE</p>\r\\n\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>', NULL, 'Grater-02A is a versatile kitchen tool designed for easily and efficiently grating and shredding ingredients like cheese, vegetables, and fruits. Its sharp stainless steel blades ensure quick and precise results, while its ergonomic handle provides a comfortable grip for effortless use. Whether you\'re preparing salads, pasta dishes, or baked goods, Grater-02A simplifies the task of creating fine and consistent textures for your culinary creations.\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>', NULL, '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0px\">â€¢ Grater- 02A (1 standard disc)</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Average output: 50kg/hour