(3763, 'Electric Waffle Iron for ice cream cones - GES 40', NULL, 'electric-waffle-iron-for-ice-cream-cones-ges-40-1', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0px\">â€¢ Electric Waffle Iron for ice cream cones - GES 40</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Waffle size: 250 x 250 x 4 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Power: 1.6 kW</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Outside dimensions: 305 x 440 x 230 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Weight 22 kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ volts 230 V</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ commutator-thermostat 0-300 Â° C</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ control lights</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Delivered with a brush (F05054) and a timer</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ GES 40 / Roller Grill / Made in France</p>', NULL, 'The Electric Waffle Iron GES 40 is a specialized kitchen appliance designed for crafting delectable ice cream cones at home. With its user-friendly features and advanced heating technology, you can effortlessly create perfectly textured and crispy cones. The GES 40 comes equipped with a non-stick cooking surface, ensuring easy cone removal and quick cleaning. Its adjustable temperature settings and indicator lights make it simple to achieve the ideal cone crispiness. Whether you\'re an amateur cook or a culinary enthusiast, the Electric Waffle Iron GES 40 offers a convenient solution to enjoy homemade ice cream cones that perfectly complement your favorite frozen treats.', NULL, '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0px\">â€¢ Electric Waffle Iron for ice cream cones - GES 40</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Waffle size: 250 x 250 x 4 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Power: 1.6 kW</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Outside dimensions: 305 x 440 x 230 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Weight