(3775, 'Venarro DEF-MK2 Fermentation Chamber with Carriage', NULL, 'venarro-def-mk2-fermentation-chamber-with-carriage-1', 'Venarro DEF-MK2 Fermentation Chamber with Carriage, 20-60x80 Tray Capacity\r\\n\r\\nGeneral Specifications:\r\\n\r\\nOperating Temperature Range: 0/90Â°C\r\\nThe Venarro DEF-MK2 Fermentation Chamber with Carriage is a single-door unit designed to enhance the efficiency and control of dough fermentation processes. It is crafted to provide ideal temperature and humidity conditions for dough proofing.\r\\nWith its spacious interior, it can easily accommodate trays and containers sized between 20-60x80 cm.\r\\nConstructed from stainless steel, it offers a hygienic and durable surface.\r\\nIts carriage design allows for easy mobility and transportation to desired locations.\r\\nImproving the Proofing Process:\r\\nThe fermentation chamber ensures that the dough proofs under ideal temperature and humidity conditions. This promotes dough rising, achieving a soft texture, and enhancing the quality of the final product.\r\\nBy optimizing the process time, it makes dough preparation more efficient.\r\\nCarriage for Tray Transport:\r\\nThe carriage design allows for easy movement and relocation, contributing to better space management and operational efficiency in your establishment.\r\\n\r\\nTechnical Specifications:\r\\nProduct Code: DEF-MK2\r\\nProduct Dimensions: 850x1280x2120 mm\r\\nPower: 10 KW - 380 V\r\\nCapacity: 20x(60x80)\r\\nWeight: 250 Kg', NULL, 'The Venarro DEF-MK2 Fermentation Chamber with Carriage is ideal for bakeries, pastry shops, and other food establishments.\r\\nIt streamlines the dough handling process, making it more efficient and effective.\r\\nIts carriage design makes it easy to use and transport.', NULL, 'Venarro DEF-MK2 Fermentation Chamber with Carriage, 20-60x80 Tray Capacity\r\\n\r\\nGeneral Specifications:\r\\n\r\\nOperating Temperature Range: 0/90Â°C\r\\nThe Venarro DEF-MK2 Fermentation Chamber with Carriage is a single-door unit designed to enhance the efficiency and control of dough fermentation processes. It is crafted to provide ideal temperature and humidity conditions for dough proofing.\r\\nWith its spacious interior, it can easily accommodate trays and containers sized between 20-60x80 cm.\r\\nConstructed from stainless steel, it offers a hygienic and durable surface.\r\\nIts carriage design allows for easy mobility and transportation to desired locations.\r\\nImproving the Proofing Process:\r\\nThe fermentation chamber ensures that the dough proofs under ideal temperature and humidity conditions. This promotes dough rising, achieving a soft texture, and enhancing the quality of the final product.\r\\nBy optimizing the process time, it makes dough preparation more efficient.\r\\nCarriage for Tray Transport:\r\\nThe carriage design allows for easy movement and relocation, contributing to better space management and operational efficiency in your establishment.\r\\n\r\\nTechnical Specifications:\r\\nProduct Code: DEF-MK2\r\\nProduct Dimensions: 850x1280x2120 mm\r\\nPower: 10 KW - 380 V\r\\nCapacity: 20x(60x80)\r\\nWeight: 250 Kg', 14150.00, 15.00, 12027.50, 50, 0, 107, 111, NULL, 95, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', NULL, NULL, 'DEF-MK2', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:24', '2026-04-18 14:51:33', NULL, 0),
