(3788, 'Panoramic M10.AB - 10 Liter', NULL, 'panoramic-m10ab-10-liter-1', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Panoramic M10 - 10 Liter</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Bowl capacity 10 Liter</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Cooling Gas R134A / R290</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Weights &amp; Dimensions Machine Package</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Weight 16,4 kg 18,4 kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Length 250 mm 300 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Depth 390 mm* 335 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Height 700 mm 720 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ includes drip tray</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Optional Voltage 115 V 60 Hz</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Current 1,1 A</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Temperature Range +3 Â°C â€” +10 Â°C</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Energy Consumption 1,8 kWh/24h</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Power 160 W</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Cooling Power 350 W</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Supply Voltage 220-240 V 50 Hz</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Optional Voltage 208-220 V 60 Hz</p>', NULL, '<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row column-padding-0px\">\r\\n<div class=\"vc_row-fluid clr\">\r\\n<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column clr column_container \">\r\\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\r\\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\\n\r\\nPanoramic mixer cold beverage dispenser\r\\n<strong>Counter top cold beverage dispenser for cooling and dispensing natural fruit juices, ayran and all sorts of cold beverages</strong>\r\\n\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row column-padding-0px\">\r\\n<div class=\"vc_row-fluid clr\">\r\\n<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column clr column_container \">\r\\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\r\\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\\n\r\\nCounter top cold beverage dispenser; specially equiped with slow agitation system, for cooling and dispensing natural juices with particles, as well as ayran, shalgam, cold coffee, cold tea, milk and all similar cold drinks.Â Beverages cool faster and equally until the last drop thanks to the large cooling base,Â it saves energy up to 50% compared classical dispensers.Â Practical tap system allows easy dispensing of the beverage with single hand.Â Large diameter tap hose alows constant fluidity and can easily be disassembled and cleansed.\r\\nIt eliminates the risk of leakage to the engine compartment thanks to the magnetic twisted pallet system,Â hence motor is fully protected.Â It provides a homogeneous mix thanks to the magnetic and twisted pallet system, this allows the beverage to cool faster.Â In order to achieve perfect cleaning and hygiene; all parts which are in contact with the beverage can beÂ Â easily accessed and quickly cleansed.Â Polycarbonat bowl is vandal-proof and food grade.Â It is the right choice for small and mid size food-service outlets.Â Water level indicator incorporated into the drip tray serves to indicate the time to empty the tray.\r\\n\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>', NULL, '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Panoramic M10 - 10 Liter</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Bowl capacity 10 Liter</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Cooling Gas R134A / R290</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Weights &amp; Dimensions Machine Package</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Weight 16,4 kg 18,4 kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Length 250 mm 300 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Depth 390 mm* 335 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Height 700 mm 720 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ includes drip tray</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Optional Voltage 115 V 60 Hz</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Current 1,1 A</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Temperature Range +3 Â°C â€” +10 Â°C</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Energy Consumption 1,8 kWh/24h</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Power 160 W</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Cooling Power 350 W</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Supply Voltage 220-240 V 50 Hz</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Optional Voltage 208-220 V 60 Hz</p>', 1996.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 13, 14, NULL, 61, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Juice Maker, Kitchen Equipment', NULL, 'M10.AB', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:24', '2026-04-10 07:12:04', NULL, 0);
