(3789, 'Panoramic M22.AB - 22 Liters', NULL, 'panoramic-m22ab-22-liters-1', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Panoramic M 22 - 22 Liters</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Hopper Capacity 22 Liters</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Refrigerant Gas R134A/R290</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Weights and Measures Machine Parcel</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Weight 20 kg 21.6kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Width 350mm 400mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Depth 405mm* 430mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Height 755mm 795mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ dropper included</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Optional Voltage 115V 60Hz</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Flow 1.4A</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Temperature Range +3 Â°C â€” +10 Â°C</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Energy consumption 2.8kWh/24h</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Strength 250W</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Cooling Power 500W</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Supply Voltage 220-240V 50Hz</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Optional Voltage 208-220V 60Hz</p>', NULL, '<strong>The 22 liter capacity of the impact-resistant, food-grade polycarbonate chamber and the compact body of the machine are suitable for small and medium-sized businesses</strong>.\r\\n<strong>22 L panoramic cold drink dispenser with</strong>\r\\n<strong>stirrer Countertop dispenser designed for cooling and dispensing natural fruit juices, ayran and all kinds of cold drinks</strong>\r\\n\r\\nThanks to the slow-working magnetic paddle mixing system; Countertop dispenser designed especially for the cooling and distribution of natural fruit juices with particles, ayran, turnip, cold coffee, ice tea, milk and all kinds of cold drinks. Thanks to the wide cooling base, drinks cool faster and evenly down to the last drop. In this way, it provides energy savings of up to 50% compared to classical products. Practical tap system; It allows you to easily take drinks using one hand. The wide tap hose provides fast filling even for drinks with particles and can be easily disassembled and cleaned. Thanks to the magnetic pallet system, the risk of the beverage in the chamber leaking into the lower engine section is eliminated, thus extending the life of the engine. The screw pallet system provides a homogeneous mixture and faster cooling of the beverage. For perfect cleanliness and hygiene, all parts in contact with the beverage are easily accessible and can be cleaned quickly. The polycarbonate bowl is impact resistant and suitable for food use. It is a suitable solution for small and medium-sized businesses. Thanks to the level indicator on the dropper, it is easy to notice that the waste water needs to be drained before it overflows.', NULL, '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Panoramic M 22 - 22 Liters</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Hopper Capacity 22 Liters</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Refrigerant Gas R134A/R290</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Weights and Measures Machine Parcel</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Weight 20 kg 21.6kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Width 350mm 400mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Depth 405mm* 430mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Height 755mm 795mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ dropper included</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Optional Voltage 115V 60Hz</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Flow 1.4A</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Temperature Range +3 Â°C â€” +10 Â°C</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Energy consumption 2.8kWh/24h</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Strength 250W</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Cooling Power 500W</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Supply Voltage 220-240V 50Hz</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Optional Voltage 208-220V 60Hz</p>', 2506.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 13, 14, NULL, 61, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Juice Maker, Kitchen Equipment', NULL, 'M22.AB', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:24', '2026-04-10 07:12:04', NULL, 0),
(3790, 'Panoramic foamed buttermilk dispenser - KAM22.DW', NULL, 'panoramic-foamed-buttermilk-dispenser-kam22dw-1', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Panoramic foamed buttermilk dispenser - KAM22.DW</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Hopper Capacity22 LitersÂ Â Â Flow1.3A</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Â Refrigerant GasR134A/R290Â Weights</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ MeasuresMachineParcel</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Temperature Range+3 Â°C â€” +10 Â°C</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Weight21.8kg22.9kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Energy consumption2.8kWh/24h</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Width350mm400mmÂ Â Strength255WÂ Depth405mm*425mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Cooling Power500WÂ Height825mm865mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Supply VoltageÂ 220-240V 50Hz</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Optional VoltageÂ 208-220V 60Hz</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Optional VoltageÂ 115V 60Hz</p>', NULL, '<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row column-padding-0px\">\r\\n<div class=\"vc_row-fluid clr\">\r\\n<div class=\"vc_col-sm-10 wpb_column clr column_container \">\r\\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\r\\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\\n\r\\n<strong>22 L panoramic foamed buttermilk dispenser</strong>\r\\n\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<div class=\"vc_col-sm-2 wpb_column clr column_container \">\r\\n<div class=\"wpb_single_image wpb_content_element clr vc_align_\">\r\\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\\n<div class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper \"></div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row column-padding-0px\">\r\\n<div class=\"vc_row-fluid clr\">\r\\n<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column clr column_container \">\r\\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\r\\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\\n\r\\nCountertop dispenser developed for cooling and distributing buttermilk, working with a special tap system that produces foamy buttermilk.Â The only, compact, foamy buttermilk dispenser in its class.Â Thanks to the special tap system, the ayran is foamed while pouring it into the glass, so the consistency and taste of the ayran does not deteriorate, and it provides fast filling.Â Thanks to its wide cooling base, drinks cool faster and evenly down to the last drop, thus providing energy savings of up to 50% compared to conventional products.Â Thanks to the slow-working magnetic paddle mixing system, the consistency and taste of the buttermilk does not change and prevents the formation of foam in the chamber.Â The screw pallet system provides a homogeneous mixture and faster cooling of the beverage.Â Thanks to the magnetic pallet system, the risk of the beverage in the chamber leaking into the lower engine section is eliminated, thus extending the life of the engine.Â For perfect cleanliness and hygiene, all parts in contact with the beverage are easily accessible and can be cleaned quickly.Â The polycarbonate bowl is impact resistant and suitable for food use.Â Thanks to the level indicator on the dropper, it is easily noticed that the waste water needs to be drained before it overflows.\r\\n\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>', NULL, '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Panoramic foamed buttermilk dispenser - KAM22.DW</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Hopper Capacity22 LitersÂ Â Â Flow1.3A</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Â Refrigerant GasR134A/R290Â Weights</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ MeasuresMachineParcel</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Temperature Range+3 Â°C â€” +10 Â°C</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Weight21.8kg22.9kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Energy consumption2.8kWh/24h</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Width350mm400mmÂ Â Strength255WÂ Depth405mm*425mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Cooling Power500WÂ Height825mm865mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Supply VoltageÂ 220-240V 50Hz</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Optional VoltageÂ 208-220V 60Hz</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Optional VoltageÂ 115V 60Hz</p>', 3329.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 61, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', NULL, NULL, 'KAM22.DW', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:24', '2026-04-09 11:54:20', NULL, 0),
