N-MARIE\" water heating system, there is no loss of water vapor, the water level is maintained for a long time, thus preventing calcification of the resistance. If our Hot Beverage Machine operates without water, the warning light on the outside of the body will turn on, indicating that water needs to be added to the machine. If the solidified beverage becomes difficult to flow from the tap, the problem is solved with the opening pin built into the tap. For perfect cleanliness and hygiene, all parts in contact with the beverage can be easily accessed and cleaned quickly. SC05Thanks to the â€œBAIN-MARIEâ€ boiler being independent from the outer body, it prevents the user from burning his hand and there is no heat loss. Thanks to the level indicator on the dropper, it is easily noticed that the waste water needs to be drained before it overflows.', NULL, '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Panoramic Hot Drink Dispenser - SC05</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Hopper Capacity 5 Liters</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Thermostat Range 30 â€“ 90Â°C</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Weights and Measures Machine Parcel</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Weight 6.3kg 7kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Width 275mm 285mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Depth 360mm* 285mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Height 450mm 470mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Flow 3.3A</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Energy consumption10kWh/24h</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Heating Power 700W</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Supply Voltage 220-240V 50Hz</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Optional Voltage 208-220V 60Hz</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Optional Voltage 115V 60Hz</p>', 1639.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 17, NULL, NULL, 61, NULL, 