(3804, 'Blender Drink MachineTwo-Speed - 10011', NULL, 'blender-drink-machinetwo-speed-10011-2', '<p style=\" margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Blender Drink MachineTwo-Speed - 10011</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Reliable robust performer.</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Wet blade, for versatile blending</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Suitable for coffee shops and cafÃ©s</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Tamper stick to push dense ingredients down through the blade.</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ 1.4 Ltr high-impact stackable container with wet blade.</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ ~2.3 HP (peak output)* motor. </p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Simple 2 - speed operation.</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Motor: ~2.3 HP (peak output)* motor</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Electrical: Standard single phase 10 Amp plug, 230 V, 50/60 Hz, 1000 - 1200 Watts (load dependent)</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Includes: 1.4 litre high-impact, clear/stackable container, complete with Wet blade assembly, lid and base\r\\n</p>', NULL, '<strong>Reliable, simple and efficient blending.</strong>\r\\nIdeal for blending fresh fruit, liquid smoothie and coffee mixes and ice\r\\nor ice cream.\r\\nPrecision engineering and robust construction allows these blenders\r\\nto homogenise the ingredients. The result is creamier, smoother frozen\r\\ndrinks with ice crystals so fine and so thoroughly blended, that they do\r\\nnot separate or lose their flavour.\r\\nWith a two-speed switch, the operation can be tailored to suit the\r\\nvarious methods used to mix different types of drinks.', NULL, '<p style=\" margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Blender Drink MachineTwo-Speed - 10011</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Reliable robust performer.</p>\r\\n<p style