nding from delicate tomatoes to dense meat</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Large 5.6 litre container provides extra blending capacity for both hot and cold ingredients</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Pulse function and variable speed control allow for flexibility and </p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ XL Blade</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ 5.6 litre and 2.0 litre high impact clear container </p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Basic Start/stop function</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ 1-10 speed settings</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Pulse switch</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Tamper stick</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ DIMENSIONS 216W x 483D x 459H mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Power Supply: 240V, 50Hz, 10A</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Power Output: 1700W-1900W</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Motor: â‰ˆ 4.2HP</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Weight: 22.7kg</p>', 11830.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 70, 122, NULL, 79, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Blenders, COFFEE & BAR LINE, Kitchen Equipment', NULL, '10185 XL', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:25', '2026-04-18 14:51:33', NULL, 0),
(3810, 'Blender Container High-Impact  - 15506', NULL, 'blender-container-high-impact-15506-1', 'Blender Container High-Impact - 15506\r\\nCapacity 48 oz.\r\\nDepth 9.1 in.\r\\nHeight 13.4 in.\r\\nWeight 2 lbs.\r\\nWidth 7.6 in.\r\\nType : Blender Parts &amp; Accessories', NULL, '<strong>Blender Container High-Impact - 15506</strong>\r\\nThe Vita-Mix blender is a staple of the kitchen. Because it is used so often, multiple blender containers are necessary to keep up with customer demands that come through. This Vita-Mix 15506 High-Impact Blender 48 ounce Container is made of clear, polycarbonate, that is high-impact to withstand the tough and frozen ingredients that it will encounter. This container fits Touch &amp; Go 2 and Drink Machine blenders. Includes stainless steel ice blade assembly and lid.\r\\n\r\\n<em>This product measures 13.4 inches high, 7.6 inches wide, and 9.1 inches deep.</em>\r\\n<strong>Features</strong>\r\\nHigh impact, BPA free, polycarbonate, 48 ounce container\r\\nIncludes stainless steel ice blade assembly and lid\r\\nFor use with Touch &amp; Go 2 and Drink Machine blenders', NULL, 'Blender Container High-Impact - 15506\r\\nCapacity 48 oz.\r\\nDepth 9.1 in.\r\\nHeight 13.4 in.\r\\nWeight 2 lbs.\r\\nWidth 7.6 in.\r\\nType : Blender Parts &amp; Accessories', 728.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 70, 122, NULL, 79, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Blenders, COFFEE & BAR LINE, Kitchen Equipment', NULL, '15506', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:25', '2026-04-18 14:51:33', NULL, 0),
