 Steel</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Safety protection to comply with IEC (international electrotechnical commission)norms</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Temperature control by capillary thermostat</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Double Auto boil dry protection for enhanced safety</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Non drip faucet with superior nickel finish 13A fused moulded British Standard Plug</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Dual indicator lamp for heat monitoring</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ 50/60Hz</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ 220V</p>', 455.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 1, 8, 10, 64, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Water Boiler', NULL, 'SHU111', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:25', '2026-04-18 14:51:33', NULL, 0),
