(3841, 'Professional electric waffle iron - GES 10', NULL, 'professional-electric-waffle-iron-ges-10-1', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0px\">â€¢ Professional electric waffle iron - GES 10</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ <strong>Technical characteristics</strong></p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Waffle size 100 x 170 x 22 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Power 1.6 kW</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Outside dimensions 305 x 440 x 230 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Weight 22 kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ volts 230 V</p>', NULL, 'The Professional Electric Waffle Iron - GES 10 is a high-performance appliance designed for both commercial and home use. Featuring a robust stainless steel construction, it ensures durability and longevity. The GES 10 comes with precise temperature control, allowing for perfectly cooked waffles every time. Its non-stick plates make for easy cleanup, while the compact design saves counter space. Ideal for cafes, restaurants, and serious home cooks, this waffle iron delivers consistent results and professional-grade performance.', NULL, '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0px\">â€¢ Professional electric waffle iron - GES 10</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ <strong>Technical characteristics</strong></p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Waffle size 100 x 170 x 22 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Power 1.6 kW</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Outside dimensions 305 x 440 x 230 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Weight 22 kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ volts 230 V</p>', 3041.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 17, 30, 31, 58, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Waffle Maker', NULL, 'GES 10', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:25', '2026-04-18 14:51:33', NULL, 0),
(3842, 'Professional Pizza Oven Extra Large - PZ 430 2D', NULL, 'professional-pizza-oven-extra-large-pz-430-2d-1', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Professional Pizza Oven Extra Large - PZ 430 2D</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Capacity Ã˜ 2 x 32 cm or 600x400 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Power 5 kW</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Outside dimensions 895 x 580 x270 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Weight 57 kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ volts 380 V ou 230 V mono</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Inside dimensions 660 x 430 x 110 mm</p>\r\\n\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" style=\"transform: translate(729px, 328px);\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" style=\"transform: translate(1px, 253px);\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" style=\"transform: translate(478px, 207px);\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>', NULL, '<strong>Professional Pizza Oven Extra Large - PZ 430 2D </strong>\r\\nThe professional pizza oven PZ 430 2D is particularly innovative in its double regulation.\r\\nThe professional pizza oven PZ 430 2D is equipped with an innovative system of double regulation of the vault and the bottom of the oven:\r\\n\r\\n- A thermostat regulates the oven chamber and the infrared quartz in the upper part\r\\n\r\\n- A power regulator for the bottom, that is to say the firestone and infrared quartz in the lower part.\r\\n\r\\nThanks to its innovative technology, the deck oven PZ 430 2D offers varied and very fast cooking possibilities.\r\\nIn addition to its double regulation system, the deck oven PZ 430 2D is equipped with infrared quartz tubes in the upper part and under the firestone. These infrared quartz spread a radiation of 1050 Â° C on the products to be cooked. They ensure fast and thorough cooking of products.\r\\n\r\\nThe combination of these two revolutionary technologies gives exceptional cooking results in the infrared oven PZ 430 2D:\r\\n\r\\n- 2 fresh pizzas Ã˜32 cm at 350 Â° C in 3 minutes!\r\\n\r\\n- 2 frozen pizzas Ã˜32 cm at 350 Â° C in 3\'30 minutes!\r\\n\r\\nAdapt your deck oven with firestone \"special pizza\"! You can regulate the lower part for all pizzas with thin dough (Tuscan pizza), thicker basis (Neapolitan pizza) or very thick dough (\"American pan pizza\"). This power control offers you the possibility to cook a wide variety of pancakes, chapatis, flambÃ© tarts, pastries etc. according to their dough.\r\\n\r\\nFeatures: firestone for even cooking, 15-minutes-sound-timer lock position for non-stop use, 2 thermic controls (Thermostat 0-350 Â° + power regulator), control lights. Double insulated door with tempered glass.\r\\n\r\\nOption: stainless steel kit KPZ 430 to stack up to 3 Roller Grill pizza ovens.\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" style=\"transform: translate(1px, 154px);\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" style=\"transform: translate(2px, 144px);\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>', NULL, '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Professional Pizza Oven Extra Large - PZ 430 2D</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Capacity Ã˜ 2 x 32 cm or 600x400 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Power 5 kW</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Outside dimensions 895 x 580 x270 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Weight 57 kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ volts 380 V ou 230 V mono</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Inside dimensions 660 x 430 x 110 mm</p>\r\\n\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" style=\"transform: translate(729px, 328px);\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" style=\"transform: translate(1px, 253px);\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" style=\"transform: translate(478px, 207px);\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>', 5291.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 77, 83, NULL, 58, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Bakery Oven, Kitchen Equipment', NULL, 'PZ 430 2D', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:25', '2026-04-18 14:51:33', NULL, 0),
(3843, 'Infrared conveyor toaster for breakfast - CT 540 B', NULL, 'infrared-conveyor-toaster-for-breakfast-ct-540-b-1', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0px\">â€¢ Infrared conveyor toaster for breakfast - CT 540 B</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Inside dimensions 85 mm (hauteur)</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Power 2,65 kW</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Outside dimensions 510 x 680 x 455 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Baking surface 330 x 335 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Weight 20 kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ volts 230 V</p>\r\\n\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>', NULL, '<strong>Infrared conveyor toaster for breakfast - CT 540 B</strong>\r\\nThe infrared conveyor toaster CT 540 B indispensable for continuous use at breakfast!\r\\nThe infrared conveyor toaster CT 540 B is equipped with 2 ramps of 4 infrared quartz tubes. These infrared quartz spread rays of 1050 Â° C on the products. It enables the hotel guest to quickly and continuously toast or heat every kind of bread for breakfast: 300 to 540 toasts per hour according to the type of bread without preheating!\r\\n\r\\nThe infrared quartz on the upper part is protected by a patented cover.\r\\n\r\\nThe quartz grill CT 540 B is extremely flexible in use and maintenance!\r\\nThe quartz grill CT 540 B is a very flexible conveyor toaster thanks to its 2 independent settings:\r\\n\r\\n- A switch selects the quartz ramps on top and bottom\r\\n\r\\n- The speed of the conveyor belt is regulated according to the product to be cooked or to be reheated. The minimum pass through time is 47 seconds. The maximum pass through time of is 2 minutes and 30 seconds.\r\\n\r\\nTwo exits are possible depending on the products:\r\\n\r\\n- The front exit is used for bread, brioche, bagels etc.\r\\n\r\\n- The rear exit is recommended for heavier and more delicate products such as big slices of farmhouse bread (30 cm in diameter), buttered slices, baguettes, pastries, delicacies, quiche etc.\r\\n\r\\nThe top roof keeps breads or pastries ready for use at the hotel\'s breakfast buffet.\r\\n\r\\nThe conveyor toaster can be cleaned very easy. The carpet is cleaned with a brush supplied with the quartz grill. The top as well as the 2 sliding trays placed at the entrance and exit under the carpet are completely removable.\r\\n\r\\nFeatures: 2 ramps of 4 quartz tubes (1550 W at the top, 1450 W at the bottom), heating selector, variable speed drive, conveyor belt made of flexible stainless steel mesh, 15 cm front and rear trays, pilot lights, ventilated motor, adjustable feet.\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>', NULL, '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0px\">â€¢ Infrared conveyor toaster for breakfast - CT 540 B</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Inside dimensions 85 mm (hauteur)</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Power 2,65 kW</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Outside dimensions 510 x 680 x 455 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Baking surface 330 x 335 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Weight 20 kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ volts 230 V</p>\r\\n\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>', 5829.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 17, 26, 27, 58, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Toaster', NULL, 'CT 540 B', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:25', '2026-04-18 14:51:33', NULL, 0),
(3844, 'Professional sausage heater with 11 rollers - RG 11 B', NULL, 'professional-sausage-heater-with-11-rollers-rg-11-b-2', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0px\">â€¢ Professional sausage heater with 11 rollers - RG 11 B</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Weight 20 kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ volts 230 V</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Outside dimensions 545 x 460 x 240 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Power 1,4 kW</p>\r\\n\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>', NULL, '<strong>Professional sausage heater with 11 rollers - RG 11 B</strong>\r\\nThe professional sausage heater RG 11 is very efficient and ideal for high-speed service!\r\\nThe professional sausage heater RG 11 is fitted out with 11 rolls and keeps warms 20 pre-cooked sausages at right temperature for 96 hot dogs per hour! This optimal efficiency is ensured by the rotation of the rollers on themselves thanks to an asynchronous motor. Each 3-cm-diameter chrome roller has a power of 125 W. The gap between the rollers is 1.5 cm. This sausage warmer is particularly popular in hot dog concepts or football/rugby stadiums during the rush hours for a prompt service. This double sausage heater is equipped with 2 independent heating zones.\r\\n\r\\nThe sausage roller heater is very compact and can be surmounted by the bun warmer CB 20 to keep warm the hot dog buns too. An ideal package to create your own hot dog concept!\r\\n\r\\nThe sausage heater with 11 rolls is very easy to clean!\r\\nThe chrome rollers of the sausage heater make maintenance very easy and guarantee a long service life. A grease tray is placed under the rollers. This stain less steel tray is completely removable and can be cleaned in a dishwasher.\r\\n\r\\nFeatures: on / off switch, energy regulator, pilot light, high performance motor.\r\\n\r\\nOption: Breath Guard H01077SE (580 x 450 x 250 mm) for any Roller Grill sausage roller heater, with lifting rear door for service.\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>', NULL, '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0px\">â€¢ Professional sausage heater with 11 rollers - RG 11 B</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Weight 20 kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ volts 230 V</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Outside dimensions 545 x 460 x 240 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Power 1,4 kW</p>\r\\n\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>', 5132.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 17, NULL, NULL, 58, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Hot Dog Machine, SNACK MAKER', 'Hotdog Maker, Kitchen Equipment, SNACK MAKER', 'RG 11 B', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:25', '2026-04-10 06:40:16', NULL, 0),
(3845, 'Professional sausage heater with 7 rollers - RG 7 B', NULL, 'professional-sausage-heater-with-7-rollers-rg-7-b-1', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Professional sausage heater with 7 rollers - RG 7 B</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Weight 14 kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ volts 230 V</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Power 0,9 kW</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Outside dimensions 545 x 320 x 240 mm</p>\r\\n\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" style=\"transform: translate(504px, 15px);\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>', NULL, '<strong>Professional sausage heater with 7 rollers - RG 7 B</strong>\r\\nThe professional sausage heater RG 7 is very efficient and ideal for high-speed service!\r\\nThe professional sausage heater RG 7 is fitted out with 7 rolls and keeps warms 12 pre-cooked sausages at right temperature for 58 hot dogs per hour! This optimal efficiency is ensured by the rotation of the rollers on themselves thanks to an asynchronous motor. Each 3-cm-diameter chrome roller has a power of 125 W. The gap between the rollers is 1.5 cm. This sausage warmer is particularly popular in hot dog concepts or football/rugby stadiums during the rush hours for a prompt service.\r\\n\r\\nThe sausage roller heater is very compact and can be surmounted by the bun warmer CB 20 to keep warm the hot dog buns too. An ideal package to create your own hot dog concept!\r\\n\r\\nThe sausage heater with 7 rolls is very easy to clean!\r\\nThe chrome rollers of the sausage heater make maintenance very easy and guarantee a long service life. A grease tray is placed under the rollers. This stain less steel tray is completely removable and can be cleaned in a dishwasher.\r\\n\r\\nFeatures: on / off switch, energy regulator, pilot light, high performance motor.\r\\n\r\\nOption: Breath Guard H01077SE (580 x 450 x 250 mm) for any Roller Grill sausage roller heater, with lifting rear door for service.\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" style=\"transform: translate(165px, 37px);\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>', NULL, '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Professional sausage heater with 7 rollers - RG 7 B</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Weight 14 kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ volts 230 V</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Power 0,9 kW</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Outside dimensions 545 x 320 x 240 mm</p>\r\\n\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" style=\"transform: translate(504px, 15px);\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>', 3640.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 58, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', NULL, NULL, 'RG 7 B', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:25', '2026-04-09 11:54:20', NULL, 0),
(3846, 'Infrared salamander toaster â€“ 1 cooking level GN 1/1 - TS 1270', NULL, 'infrared-salamander-toaster-1-cooking-level-gn-1/1-ts-1270-1', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Infrared salamander toaster â€“ 1 cooking level GN 1/1 - TS 1270</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Cooking surface 520 X 320 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Capacity 1 x GN 1/1</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Power 2.47 kW</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Outside dimensions 640 x 380 x 335 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Weight 13 kG</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ volts 230 V</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Useful height 85 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ 100% Made in FRANCE</p>', NULL, '<strong>Infrared salamander toaster â€“ 1 cooking level GN 1/1 - TS 1270</strong>\r\\nThe infrared salamander toaster TS 1270: the champion of cooking!\r\\nThe infrared salamander toaster TS 1270 is equipped with 2 ramps of 3 infrared quartz tubes. This electric toaster can cook without preheating, without smoke or smell, any type of snacks. The infrared quartz spread a harmless radiation of 1050 Â° C on the products to be cooked. They ensure a fast and thorough cooking at core of the products.\r\\n\r\\nThe infrared quartz tubes of this stainless steel toaster are protected by a patented protection grid.\r\\n\r\\nVary your cooking with the professional toaster TS 1270 !\r\\nThe professional toaster TS 1270 can cook up to 200 toasts per hour!\r\\n\r\\nThanks to its Gastronorm GN 1/1 capacity, the infrared salamander toaster TS 1270 makes it possible to vary cooking in big quantities such as :\r\\n\r\\n- to cook and reheat a croque-monsieur, quiche or pizza,\r\\n\r\\n- to brown onion soup, eggs casserole, gratins\r\\n\r\\n- to toast all kinds of bread in long or round slices, thick or thin\r\\n\r\\n- to defrost frozen dishes.\r\\n\r\\nFeatures: selector for infrared quartz ramps, 15-minute-timer with lock position for non-stop use, control lights, patented protection grid for quartz tubes, crumb tray.\r\\n\r\\nOption : Sandwich tong ( F01013 )', NULL, '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Infrared salamander toaster â€“ 1 cooking level GN 1/1 - TS 1270</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Cooking surface 520 X 320 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Capacity 1 x GN 1/1</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Power 2.47 kW</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Outside dimensions 640 x 380 x 335 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Weight 13 kG</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ volts 230 V</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Useful height 85 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ 100% Made in FRANCE</p>', 2925.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 17, 26, NULL, 58, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Salamander', NULL, 'TS 1270', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:25', '2026-04-18 14:51:33', NULL, 0);
