(3847, 'Infrared salamander toaster â€“ 2 cooking levels GN 1/1 - TS 3270', NULL, 'infrared-salamander-toaster-2-cooking-levels-gn-1/1-ts-3270-1', '<p style=\" margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Infrared salamander toaster â€“ 2 cooking levels GN 1/1 - TS 3270 </p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Capacity	1 x GN 1/1</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Power	4 kW or 2x2 kW (2 cords)</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Outside dimensions	640 x 380 x475 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Baking surface	2 (520 x 320) mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Weight	19 kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ volts	380 V or 230 V mono</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Useful height	85 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ 100% Made in FRANCE</p>', NULL, '<strong>Infrared salamander toaster â€“ 2 cooking levels GN 1/1 - TS 3270 </strong>\r\\nThe infrared salamander toaster TS 3270: the champion of cooking!\r\\nThe infrared salamander toaster TS 3270 is equipped with 3 ramps of 3 infrared quartz tubes. This electric toaster can cook without preheating, without smoke or smell, any type of snacks. The infrared quartz spread a harmless radiation of 1050 Â° C on the products to be cooked. They ensure a fast and thorough cooking at core of the products.\r\\n\r\\nFor a fast service during rush hours, the upper compartment of this double toaster is exclusively equipped with a closed tray-grid with handles.\r\\n\r\\nThe infrared quartz tubes of this stainless steel toaster are protected by a patented protection grid.\r\\n\r\\nVary your cooking with the professional toaster TS 3270 !\r\\nThe professional toaster TS 3270 can cook up to 200 toasts per hour!\r\\n\r\\nThanks to its 2 cooking levels and it Gastronorm GN 2/1 capacity, the infrared salamander toaster TS 3270 makes it possible to vary cooking in large quantities such as :\r\\n\r\\n- to cook and reheat a croque-monsieur, quiche or pizza,\r\\n\r\\n- to brown onion soup, eggs casserole, gratins\r\\n\r\\n- to toast all kinds of bread in long or round slices, thick or thin\r\\n\r\\n- to defrost frozen dishes.\r\\n\r\\nFeatures: selector for infrared quartz ramps, 15-minute-timer with lock position for non-stop use, control lights, patented protection grid for quartz tubes, crumb tray.\r\\n\r\\nOption : Sandwich tong ( F01013 )', NULL, '<p style=\" margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Infrared salamander toaster â€“ 2 cooking levels GN 1/1 - TS 3270 </p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Capacity	1 x GN 1/1</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Power	4 kW or 2x2 kW (2 cords)</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Outside dimensions	640 x 380 x475 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Baking surface	2 (520 x 320) mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Weight	19 kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ volts	380 V or 230 V mono</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Useful height	85 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\" margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ 100% Made in FRANCE</p>', 3510.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 17, 26, NULL, 58, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Salamander, Top Brands', NULL, 'TS 3270', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:26', '2026-04-18 14:51:33', NULL, 0),
(3848, 'Ventilated negative display cabinet RDN 800', NULL, 'ventilated-negative-display-cabinet-rdn-800-2', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Ventilated negative display cabinet - Glass shelves, large model - RDN 800</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Inside dimensions 710 x 560 x 1170 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Capacity 480 l</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Power 0,80 kW</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Outside dimensions 800 x 645 x 1850 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Weight 200 kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ volts 230 V</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ 100% Made in FRANCE</p>', NULL, '<strong>Ventilated negative display cabinet - Glass shelves, large model - RDN 800</strong>\r\\nHighlight your frozen desserts at good temperature in the negative display cabinet with glass shelves!\r\\nPanoramic and equipped with a 4 LED lighting, the ventilated negative display cabinet RDN 800 enhances your ice creams, pastries and frozen pies.\r\\n\r\\nYour pastries and ice cream creations are presented on 5 glass shelves measuring 610 x 510 mm and adjustable on 6 levels.\r\\n\r\\nThe vertical showcase RDN 800 is equipped with a very efficient cold system.\r\\nThe ventilated refrigeration system ensures a uniform temperature of -5 to -20 Â° C throughout the vertical showcase.\r\\n\r\\nThe evaporator placed in the upper part guarantees a homogeneous cold throughout the showcase.\r\\n\r\\nThe electronic thermostat allows automatic defrosting every 2 hours.\r\\n\r\\nPerfectly insulated, this vertical showcase with negative cold is equipped with triple glazed walls.\r\\n\r\\nAll refrigerated pastry display cabinets are factory tested at an ambient outside temperature of 29 Â° C.\r\\n\r\\nFeatures: electronic thermostat control, 4 LED ramps, magnetic closing door, triple glazing, Tecumseh FRANCE compressor, R290 gas. Tropicalized showcase mounted on 4 double wheels. Available in 3 colors: stainless steel, black or white.\r\\n\r\\nOption: micro-hole glazing for use in the mountains.', NULL, '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Ventilated negative display cabinet - Glass shelves, large model - RDN 800</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Inside dimensions 710 x 560 x 1170 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Capacity 480 l</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Power 0,80 kW</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Outside dimensions 800 x 645 x 1850 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Weight 200 kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ volts 230 V</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ 100% Made in FRANCE</p>', 18200.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 51, 52, 58, 58, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Display Chiller, Kitchen Equipment, REFRIGERATION LINE', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:26', '2026-04-18 14:51:33', NULL, 0),
(3849, 'Ventilated positive display cabinet - Glass shelves - RD 600', NULL, 'ventilated-positive-display-cabinet-glass-shelves-rd-600-2', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0px\">â€¢ Ventilated positive display cabinet - Glass shelves - RD 600</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Inside dimensions 520 x 580 x 1170 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Capacity 360 l</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Power 0,43 kW</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Outside dimensions 600 X 645 X 1850 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Weight 150 kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ volts 230 V</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ 100% Made in FRANCE</p>', NULL, '<strong>Ventilated positive display cabinet - Glass shelves - RD 600</strong>\r\\nHighlight your desserts at the right temperature in the refrigerated display cabinet with glass shelves!\r\\nPanoramic and equipped with 4 LED lighting, the refrigerated display cabinet RD 600 sublimates your pastries, your pies and all your desserts with fruit.\r\\n\r\\nYour pastries and culinary creations are presented on 5 glass shelves measuring 465 x 455 mm and adjustable on 6 levels.\r\\n\r\\nThe vertical showcase RD 600 is equipped with a very efficient cold system.\r\\nThe ventilated refrigeration system ensures a uniform temperature of +2 to + 10 Â° C throughout the vertical showcase.\r\\n\r\\nThe evaporator placed in the upper part guarantees a homogeneous cold in the whole refrigerated display cabinet.\r\\n\r\\nThe electronic thermostat allows automatic defrosting every 2 hours.\r\\n\r\\nPerfectly insulated, this vertical showcase with positive cold is equipped with double glazed walls.\r\\n\r\\nAll refrigerated pastry display cabinets are factory tested at an ambient outside temperature of 29 Â° C.\r\\n\r\\nFeatures: electronic thermostat control, 4 LED ramps, magnetic closing door, double glazing, Tecumseh FRANCE compressor, R290. Tropicalized showcase mounted on 4 double wheels. Available in 3 colors: stainless steel, black or white.\r\\n\r\\nOption: micro-hole glazing for use in the mountains.', NULL, '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0px\">â€¢ Ventilated positive display cabinet - Glass shelves - RD 600</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Inside dimensions 520 x 580 x 1170 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Capacity 360 l</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Power 0,43 kW</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Outside dimensions 600 X 645 X 1850 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Weight 150 kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ volts 230 V</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ 100% Made in FRANCE</p>', 10074.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 51, 52, 58, 58, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Display Chiller, Kitchen Equipment, REFRIGERATION LINE', NULL, 'RD 600', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:26', '2026-04-18 14:51:33', NULL, 0),
(3850, 'Ventilated heated display showcase - 3 grids - WD 780 DN', NULL, 'ventilated-heated-display-showcase-3-grids-wd-780-dn-1', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Ventilated heated display showcase - 3 grids - WD 780 DN</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Inside dimensions 750 x 460 x 530 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Power 1.8 kW</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Outside dimensions 780 x 490 x 640 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Weight 35 kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ volts 230 V</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Grilles 3 x (670 x 433 mm)</p>', NULL, '<strong>Ventilated heated display showcase - 3 grids - WD 780 DN</strong>\r\\nThe heated showcase WD 780 DN features a unique ventilated firestone heating system!\r\\n- The firestone placed on the Incoloy heating element accumulates, releases and spreads the heat in the showcase. It guarantees a sufficient temperature (72 Â° C) of meat-based snacks such as nuggets, meatballs or delicacies.\r\\n\r\\n- The 2 fans spreads the heat evenly throughout the showcase\r\\n\r\\n- The electronic thermostat regulates the temperature from 20 to 90 Â° C with a precision to the nearest degree.\r\\n\r\\n- A water drawer allows a humidity control essential to keep moist and delicious the sweet pastries and delicatessen.\r\\n\r\\nThis ventilated heated showcase, equipped with 4 LED ramps, highlights and keeps warm in quantities quiches, pizzas, fondues, meatballs, pastries and so on. The display is supplied with 3 grids (670 x 433 mm each). It can receive Gastronorm GN 1/1 dishes, 400 x 600 mm dishes or 3 American dishes.\r\\n\r\\nThe professional showcase WD 780 DN is very easy to use and to clean.\r\\nThe rear glass doors open at 180 Â° C for the loading of the professional showcase and for the service.\r\\n\r\\nThe grids and theirs supports, the stainless steel lower tray, the water drawer and the firestone are completely removable.\r\\n\r\\nThe professional showcase WD 780 is available in stainless steel or black version.\r\\n\r\\nFeatures: electronic thermostat (20-90 Â° C), water drawer, on / off switch, switch for ventilation, fans, firestone. Supplied with 3 grids. Additional grids on request. Delivered with no GN tray.', NULL, '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Ventilated heated display showcase - 3 grids - WD 780 DN</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Inside dimensions 750 x 460 x 530 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Power 1.8 kW</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Outside dimensions 780 x 490 x 640 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Weight 35 kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ volts 230 V</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Grilles 3 x (670 x 433 mm)</p>', 4355.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 107, 109, NULL, 58, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Salamander', NULL, 'WD 780 DN', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:26', '2026-04-18 14:51:33', NULL, 0),
(3851, 'Meat Smoker Oven - CST290', NULL, 'meat-smoker-oven-cst290-1', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Meat Smoker Oven - CST290</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Weight 250 kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Trays 4</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Length 70cm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Width 95cm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Height 185cm</p>', NULL, '<strong><em>Meat Smoker Oven - CST290</em></strong>\r\\n<strong>SMOKES THE MEAT - KEEPS THE MEAT WARM\r\\nTHE SMOKE CHANGES ACCORDING TO THE COAL OR WOOD USE</strong>\r\\nDiscover the perfect balance of flavor and convenience with our 4-Tray Meat Smoker Oven. Elevate your grilling experience as you infuse your favorite meats with irresistible smokiness. The four spacious trays provide ample space for a variety of culinary creations, while precise temperature control ensures deliciously smoked results every time. Unleash the essence of slow-cooked perfection in the comfort of your kitchen â€“ your journey to flavorful, smoky dishes starts here!', NULL, '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Meat Smoker Oven - CST290</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Weight 250 kg</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Trays 4</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Length 70cm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Width 95cm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Height 185cm</p>', 9499.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 17, 37, 43, 38, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Bakery Oven, Kitchen Equipment', NULL, 'CST290', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:26', '2026-04-18 14:51:33', NULL, 0),
(3852, 'Suitable for fryers up to 12 volume -VITO 30', NULL, 'suitable-for-fryers-up-to-12-volume-vito-30-1', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Suitable for fryers up to 12 volume -VITO 30</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ <strong>Benefits:</strong></p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Increases the lifetime of your oil</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Improves taste and quality</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Saves time and labor</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ <strong>Specifications</strong></p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Normal usage Ideal for fryers up to 12 l / 22 lbs</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Filtration power up to 30 l/min</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ 66 lbs/min</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Filtration efficiency up to 5 Âµm / 200Âµin</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Particle uptake 0,8 kg / 1.8 lbs</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Work cycle 4.5 min</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Suction depth ~ 20 cm / ~ 7.9 in</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Weight 6,3 kg / 14 lbs</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Temperature max. 200Â°C / 392Â°F</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Material Stainless steel 1.4301</p>', NULL, 'The VITO 30 cleans the oil and provides an easy and hygienic filtration in the kitchen. Like every VITO oil filter system the VITO 30 provides a microfiltration up to 5 Âµm (200Âµin). As an additional feature no chemicals are needed to clean the oil, which preserves the optimal taste of the fried dishes. The unique design makes sure the VITO can handle temperatures up to 200Â°C (392Â°F) and provides highest safety at work, because of avoiding direct contact with the hot oil. After filtration the oil can be immediately used for frying again.'