l. After filtration the oil can easily be pumped back into the fryer automatically.', NULL, '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Tank volume 120 - VITO XL</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Benefits:</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Increases the lifetime of your oil</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Improves taste and quality</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Saves time and labor</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Specifications</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Normal usage Ideal for catering industry and bakeries or high frying volume</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Filtration power up to 30 l/min</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ 66 lbs/min</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Filtration efficiency up to 5 Âµm / 200Âµin</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Pumping capacity up to 35 l/min</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ 77 lbs/min</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Tank Volume 120 l / 219 lbs</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Particle uptake 10,7 kg / 23.6 lbs</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Weight 64 kg / 141 lbs</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Temperature max. 200Â°C / 392Â°F</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Material Stainless steel 1.4301</p>', 32000.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 17, 45, 49, 82, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', NULL, NULL, 'VITO XL', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:26', '2026-04-18 14:51:33', NULL, 0),
(3858, 'Frying oil tester and temperature measurement - VITO FT 440', NULL, 'frying-oil-tester-and-temperature-measurement-vito-ft-440-1', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Frying oil tester and temperature measurement - VITO FT 440</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Specifications</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Dimensions 54 x 22 x 314 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Parameters % TPM, Â°C/Â°F</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Resolution 0.5% TMP, 0.1 Â°C/Â°F</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Range TPM 0 - 40%</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Range Â°C/Â°F 50Â°C - 200Â°C / 122Â°F - 392Â°F</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Accuracy Â±2.0% TPM, Â±1Â°C/Â°F</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Battery 3V Lithium (CR 2477)</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ IP Code IP 67</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Alarm 3-color traffic light function</p>\r\\n\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" style=\"transform: translate(973px, 323px);\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>', NULL, 'The FT 440 determines the temperature and the quality of your frying oil. Measuring the \"Total Polar Material\" (TPM) content in the oil, the tester gives you an accurate overview of the quality of your frying medium in a percentage value. The FT 440 comes with a top light which works after the traffic light principle and gives clear warning when it is time to dispose your fat. Never change your oil too early or too late again.\r\\n\r\\nThe FT 440 provides easy measurement and saves oil.\r\\n\r\\nMeasure the quality and temperature of your oil\r\\nChange your oil at the right time\r\\nQuick and reliable measuring results\r\\nSupports HACCP quality standards\r\\nErgonomic and sturdy design\r\\nHigh degree of protection (IP67)\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" style=\"transform: translate(101px, 119px);\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>', NULL, '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Frying oil tester and temperature measurement - VITO FT 440</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Specifications</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Dimensions 54 x 22 x 314 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Parameters % TPM, Â°C/Â°F</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Resolution 0.5% TMP, 0.1 Â°C/Â°F</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Range TPM 0 - 40%</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Range Â°C/Â°F 50Â°C - 200Â°C / 122Â°F - 392Â°F</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Accuracy Â±2.0% TPM, Â±1Â°C/Â°F</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Battery 3V Lithium (CR 2477)</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ IP Code IP 67</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Alarm 3-color traffic light function</p>\r\\n\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" style=\"transform: translate(973px, 323px);\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>', 2100.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 82, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', NULL, NULL, 'VITO FT 440', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:26', '2026-04-09 11:54:20', NULL, 0),
(3859, 'Frying oil tester and temperature measurement - VITO oiltester', NULL, 'frying-oil-tester-and-temperature-measurement-vito-oiltester-1', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Frying oil tester and temperature measurement - VITO oiltester</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ <strong>Specifications</strong></p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Dimensions 48 x 173 x 298 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Parameters % TPM, Â°C/Â°F</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Resolution 0.5% TMP, 0.1 Â°C/Â°F</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Range TPM 0 - 40%</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Range Â°C/Â°F 40Â°C - 200Â°C / 104Â°F - 392Â°F</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Accuracy Â±2.0% TPM, Â±1.5Â°C/Â°F</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Battery 2x 1.5V AAA</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ IP Code IP 65</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Alarm 3-color traffic light function</p>\r\\n\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" style=\"transform: translate(744px, 238px);\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>', NULL, 'The VITO oiltester determines the temperature and the quality of your frying oil. Measuring the \"Total Polar Material\" (TPM) content in the oil, the tester gives you an accurate overview of the quality of your frying medium in a percentage value. The VITO oiltester comes with a colored display which works after the traffic light principle and gives clear warning when it is time to dispose your fat. Never change your oil too early or too late again.\r\\n\r\\nâ€¢Measure the quality and temperature of your oil\r\\nâ€¢Change your oil at the right time\r\\nâ€¢Quick and reliable measuring results\r\\nâ€¢Supports HACCP quality standards\r\\nâ€¢Ergonomic and sturdy design\r\\nâ€¢High degree of protection (IP65)\r\\nâ€¢Clear alarms via colored display using the traffc light principle\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" style=\"transform: translate(65px, 48px);\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" style=\"transform: translate(418px, 111px);\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>', NULL, '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Frying oil tester and temperature measurement - VITO oiltester</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ <strong>Specifications</strong></p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Dimensions 48 x 173 x 298 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Parameters % TPM, Â°C/Â°F</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Resolution 0.5% TMP, 0.1 Â°C/Â°F</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Range TPM 0 - 40%</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Range Â°C/Â°F 40Â°C - 200Â°C / 104Â°F - 392Â°F</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Accuracy Â±2.0% TPM, Â±1.5Â°C/Â°F</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Battery 2x 1.5V AAA</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ IP Code IP 65</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Alarm 3-color traffic light function</p>\r\\n\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" style=\"transform: translate(744px, 238px);\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>', 2200.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 82, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', NULL, NULL, 'VITO oiltester', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:26', '2026-04-09 11:54:20', NULL, 0),
(3860, 'Cellulose particle filter - 1 box = 100 pcs - VITO 30', NULL, 'cellulose-particle-filter-1-box-=-100-pcs-vito-30-1', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Cellulose particle filter - 1 box = 100 pcs - VITO 30</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ VITO Particle filters</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ The VITO particle filters keep all particles that are filtered out of the oil by the frying oil filter machines.\r\\nThey are placed inside the unit and can be used for several filtration cycles.\r\\nThe filters are made of cellulose and are therefore biodegradable.</p>\r\\n\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" style=\"transform: translate(756px, 23px);\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>', NULL, '<strong>Cellulose particle filter - 1 box = 100 pcs - VITO 30 </strong>\r\\nVITO Particle filters\r\\nThe VITO particle filters keep all particles that are filtered out of the oil by the frying oil filter machines.\r\\nThey are placed inside the unit and can be used for several filtration cycles.\r\\nThe filters are made of cellulose and are therefore biodegradable.\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" style=\"transform: translate(33px, 183px);\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>', NULL, '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Cellulose particle filter - 1 box = 100 pcs - VITO 30</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ VITO Particle filters</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ The VITO particle filters keep all particles that are filtered out of the oil by the frying oil filter machines.\r\\nThey are placed inside the unit and can be used for several filtration cycles.\r\\nThe filters are made of cellulose and are therefore biodegradable.</p>\r\\n\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" style=\"transform: translate(756px, 23px);\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>', 755.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 17, 45, 49, 82, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', NULL, NULL, 'VITO 30', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:26', '2026-04-18 14:51:33', NULL, 0);
