(3862, 'Merrychef conneX Â® 12e', NULL, 'merrychef-connex-r-12e-1', '<strong>Specifications</strong>\r\\nHigh speed TechnologyÂ® combines three heat technologies:\r\\n-Microwave\r\\n-Convection\r\\n-Tuned impingement.\r\\nMICROWAVE POWER\r\\nâ€¢ Microwave setting options: Off and 5-100% in 1% increments.\r\\nâ€¢ Microwave distribution system uses a rotating active\r\\nantenna to ensure even heating throughout the food.\r\\nCONVECTED HEAT\r\\nâ€¢ Temperature setting options: Off and 212Â°F (100Â°C) to 500Â°F\r\\n(260Â°C) in 1Â°C increments.\r\\nâ€¢ The Heat distribution system is via Tuned Impingement,\r\\nensuring the most even browning.\r\\nVENTILATION\r\\nâ€¢ Ventless certification. EPA 202 tested (8 hr).\r\\nâ€¢ Internal catalytic filtration to limit grease and\r\\nodour emissions.\r\\neasyTouchÂ® 2.0 CONTROL SYSTEM\r\\nâ€¢ Icon driven, HD colour touch screen control panel with\r\\nunlimited storage for multi-stage cooking profiles.\r\\nâ€¢ Each cooking profile offers up to six (6) stages with\r\\nprogrammable cooking times, microwave power settings and\r\\nwritten and/or pictorial user instructions for each stage.\r\\nâ€¢ Self diagnostics capability to monitor components.\r\\nâ€¢ Easy menu updates or data transfer via USB memory stick\r\\nand KitchenConnect cloud\r\\n\r\\n<strong>Features</strong>\r\\nâ€¢ The conneXÂ®12e is our versatile entry\r\\nmodel, for high speed cooking with\r\\npre-programmed menus.\r\\nâ€¢ An all-in-one unit ideally suited to cook,\r\\ntoast, grill and reheat food, eliminating the\r\\nneed for other appliances.\r\\nâ€¢ Cooking up to 70% faster than other\r\\ncooking methods it can provide hot food\r\\non demand.\r\\nâ€¢ It has the a large cavity 30.5cm x 30.5cm\r\\n(12â€ x 12â€) to oven width 40.7 cm (16â€) ratio,\r\\nand fits on a 600mm worktop, perfect\r\\nwhen space is at a premium.\r\\nâ€¢ Suitable for front-of-house, operating\r\\nquietly and easy to install due to ventless\r\\ncooking capabilities through a built-in\r\\ncatalytic converter, eliminates the need for\r\\nan extraction fan.\r\\nâ€¢ Cool to touch exterior makes it safe to\r\\nlocate anywhere with no need to allow\r\\nspace around the unit.\r\\nâ€¢ Easy to operate with a 7â€ HD widescreen\r\\ndisplay and new generation easyTouchÂ®2.0,\r\\nicon driven controller, ensuring consistent,\r\\nhigh quality dishes.\r\\nâ€¢ Easy to clean, with on oven pictorial\r\\ninstructions.\r\\nâ€¢ Patented easy access front\r\\nmounted monitored air filter.\r\\nâ€¢ Wi-fi/ethernet connected with\r\\naccess to KitchenConnect cloud\r\\nfor easy menu updates (or, via\r\\na USB memory stick).\r\\nâ€¢ Available in Matt black only.', NULL, 'Specification : Triple heating - microwave / hot air heating / hot air jet, cooking speed 12 times faster than ordinary oven; Convected heat, Planar Plumes, impingement air and microwave energy -achieving cook times that are 12x times than conventional ovens,The image menu and touch screen make cooking simple and fast, ideal for coffee shops, front kitchens, convenience stores, bakeries and other placeswhere kitchen space is limited;Ideal for coffee shops, food courts, convenience stores, bakeries etc;.â€¢ Dimension (cm): 40.60 x 53.7 x 58.7â€¢ Weight (kg): 60.7â€¢ Power: 230V/50Hz/1Phâ€¢ Manufactured in Chinaâ€¢ Parts from UKIncluded Accessories:â€¢ 1 x Cook plate linerâ€¢ 1 x Solid Cook Plateâ€¢ 1 x Guarded Paddle with supporting sidewallsâ€¢ 1 x Solid Base Basket\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" style=\"transform: translate(17px, 146px);\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>', NULL, '<strong>Specifications</strong>\r\\nHigh speed TechnologyÂ® combines three heat technologies:\r\\n-Microwave\r\\n-Convection\r\\n-Tuned impingement.\r\\nMICROWAVE POWER\r\\nâ€¢ Microwave setting options: Off and 5-100% in 1% increments.\r\\nâ€¢ Microwave distribution system uses a rotating active\r\\nantenna to ensure even heating throughout the food.\r\\nCONVECTED HEAT\r\\nâ€¢ Temperature setting options: Off and 212Â°F (100Â°C) to 500Â°F\r\\n(260Â°C) in 1Â°C increments.\r\\nâ€¢ The Heat distribution system is via Tuned Impingement,\r\\nensuring the most even browning.\r\\nVENTILATION\r\\nâ€¢ Ventless certification. EPA 202 tested (8 hr).\r\\nâ€¢ Internal catalytic filtration to limit grease and\r\\nodour emissions.\r\\neasyTouchÂ® 2.0 CONTROL SYSTEM\r\\nâ€¢ Icon driven, HD colour touch screen control panel with\r\\nunlimited storage for multi-stage cooking profiles.\r\\nâ€¢ Each cooking profile offers up to six (6) stages with\r\\nprogrammable cooking times, microwave power settings and\r\\nwritten and/or pictorial user instructions for each stage.\r\\nâ€¢ Self diagnostics capability to monitor components.\r\\nâ€¢ Easy menu updates or data transfer via USB memory stick\r\\nand KitchenConnect cloud\r\\n\r\\n<strong>Features</strong>\r\\nâ€¢ The conneXÂ®12e is our versatile entry\r\\nmodel, for high speed cooking with\r\\npre-programmed menus.\r\\nâ€¢ An all-in-one unit ideally suited to cook,\r\\ntoast, grill and reheat food, eliminating the\r\\nneed for other appliances.\r\\nâ€¢ Cooking up to 70% faster than other\r\\ncooking methods it can provide hot food\r\\non demand.\r\\nâ€¢ It has the a large cavity 30.5cm x 30.5cm\r\\n(12â€ x 12â€) to oven width 40.7 cm (16â€) ratio,\r\\nand fits on a 600mm worktop, perfect\r\\nwhen space is at a premium.\r\\nâ€¢ Suitable for front-of-house, operating\r\\nquietly and easy to install due to ventless\r\\ncooking capabilities through a built-in\r\\ncatalytic converter, eliminates the need for\r\\nan extraction fan.\r\\nâ€¢ Cool to touch exterior makes it safe to\r\\nlocate anywhere with no need to allow\r\\nspace around the unit.\r\\nâ€¢ Easy to operate with a 7â€ HD widescreen\r\\ndisplay and new generation easyTouchÂ®2.0,\r\\nicon driven controller, ensuring consistent,\r\\nhigh quality dishes.\r\\nâ€¢ Easy to clean, with on oven pictorial\r\\ninstructions.\r\\nâ€¢ Patented easy access front\r\\nmounted monitored air filter.\r\\nâ€¢ Wi-fi/ethernet connected with\r\\naccess to KitchenConnect cloud\r\\nfor easy menu updates (or, via\r\\na USB memory stick).\r\\nâ€¢ Available in Matt black only.', 29000.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 42, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', NULL, NULL, 'E1S BLACK', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:26', '2026-04-09 11:54:20', NULL, 0),
(3863, 'Merrychef conneX Â® 12', NULL, 'merrychef-connex-r-12-1', '<strong>Technical Specifications</strong>\r\\nconneXÂ®12 High Power\r\\nW x D x H	14â€³ x 251/2â€ x 243/4â€œ\r\\n35.6cm x 64.8cm x 62.9cm\r\\nWeight	111 lb\r\\n50.3 kg\r\\nPower Output	N/A\r\\nPower Input Type	Electric\r\\nPrimary Power Input	220-240 V x 60 Hz x 1 PH\r\\n230 V x 50 Hz x 1 PH\r\\nCertifications	CEUL\r\\nconneXÂ®12 Standard Power\r\\nW x D x H	14â€³ x 251/2â€ x 243/4â€œ\r\\n35.6cm x 64.8cm x 62.9cm\r\\nWeight	111 lb\r\\n50.3 kg\r\\nPower Output	N/A\r\\nPower Input Type	Electric\r\\nPrimary Power Input	220-240 V x 60 Hz x 1 PH\r\\n230 V x 50 Hz x 1 PH\r\\nCertifications	CEUL\r\\n\r\\n<strong>Features</strong>\r\\nMost versatile, high speed oven on the market\r\\nAn all-in-one unit ideally suited to rapidly cook, toast, grill, and reheat fresh or frozen food, eliminating the need for other appliances\r\\nCooking up to 20x faster than other cooking methods\r\\nLargest 30.5cm x 30.5cm (12â€ cavity with a 14â€ wide footprint\r\\nFits on a 600mm worktop\r\\nSuitable for front-of-house, operating quietly and easy to install due to ventless cooking capabilities through a built-in catalytic converter, eliminates the need for an extraction fan\r\\nCool to touch exterior makes it safe to locate anywhere with no need to allow space around the unit.\r\\nEasy to operate with a 7â€ HD widescreen display and new generation easyTouchÂ®2.0, icon driven controller, ensuring consistent, high quality dishes.\r\\nVery easy to clean stainless steel cavity with large rounded corners.\r\\nPatented easy access front mounted air filter.\r\\nWiFi/ethernet connected with access to KitchenConnect cloud for easy menu update (or update via a USB memory stick).\r\\n', NULL, '<strong>Merrychef conneX 12</strong>\r\\n \r\\nThe most compact high speed oven, with the fastest speeds.\r\\nThe very latest in high speed ovens, Merrychef conneXÂ® 12 delivers consistent, high quality food, up to 80% faster than conventiona