(3902, 'Mahlkonig EK43S Coffee Grinder Matte Black - EK43S', NULL, 'mahlkonig-ek43s-coffee-grinder-matte-black-ek43s-1', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Mahlkonig EK43S Coffee Grinder Matte Black - EK43S</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Compact version of iconic EK43 coffee grinder, ideal for smaller cafes.</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Burr type: 98mm Steel Flat.</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Grinding Capacity: 19-21 grams of coffee per second.</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Precise stepless grind adjustment.</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Suitable for filter, espresso, or even Turkish-fine coffee grinding.</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Capacity: Beans Hopper - 0.8 kg.</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Color: Matte Black.</p>\r\\n\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" style=\"transform: translate(804px, 302px);\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>', NULL, 'The Mahlkonig EK43S Coffee Grinder in Matte Black (EK43S) is a high-performance grinder designed for specialty coffee shops and discerning home baristas. Renowned for its precision and versatility, it features 98 mm flat burrs that deliver consistent particle size distribution for exceptional espresso and filter coffee extraction. The compact design of the EK43S makes it suitable for smaller spaces without compromising on performance. With stepless grind adjustment and a powerful motor, it offers unparalleled control and efficiency. The Matte Black finish adds a sleek and modern aesthetic to any coffee setup, making the Mahlkonig EK43S a standout choice for coffee enthusiasts seeking premium quality and style.\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>', NULL, '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Mahlkonig EK43S Coffee Grinder Matte Black - EK43S</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top