(3903, 'La Marzocco Smart Water Filter 35 (Filter Head +  Cartridge - BWT)', NULL, 'la-marzocco-smart-water-filter-35-filter-head-cartridge-bwt-1', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ BWT Bestmax Smart Water Filter 35 (Filter Head + Cartridge - BWT</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Special water filter system for cafes.</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Features the new High-â€‹Efficiency-â€‹Technology (HET) ensures better water optimisation.</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Provides protection against limescale and off-flavour components.</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Space-â€‹saving design that is very easy to handle.</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Ideal for the production of both hot and cold beverages.</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Flexibility of horizontal or vertical installation.</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Includes both filter head and cartridge.</p>\r\\n\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" style=\"transform: translate(1180px, 332px);\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>', NULL, 'The BWT Bestmax Smart Water Filter 35 is a comprehensive water filtration system designed to optimize water quality for coffee and espresso machines. This all-in-one solution combines a filter head and cartridge to effectively reduce scale buildup, chlorine, and other impurities that can affect the taste and performance of beverages. The Smart technology ensures precise water mineralization, enhancing the flavor and aroma of coffee while prolonging the lifespan of equipment. Easy to install and maintain, the BWT Bestmax Smart Water Filter 35 is an essential accessory for coffee professionals and enthusiasts seeking consistent and exceptional brewing results.\r\\n<div id=\"mttContainer\" class=\"notranslate\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></div>', NULL, '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ BWT Bestmax Sma