(4014, 'VERTICAL CUTTER MIXERS R30 A', NULL, 'vertical-cutter-mixers-r30-a-2', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ VERTICAL CUTTER MIXERS R30 A</p>\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ motor Yes</p>\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Power 7 HP</p>\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Voltage 3 phase 208 - 240 V</p>\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Speeds 1800 - 3600 rpm</p>\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Pulse Yes</p>\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ IP65 control panel with digital timer Yes</p>\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Bowl 28 L stainless steel bowl</p>\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Lid wiper Yes</p>\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Blade(s) 3 adjustable stainless steel smooth \"S\" blade assembly - Included</p>\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Three retractable wheels Yes</p>\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Gross weight (Lbs) 310</p>\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Dimensions\\n(W Ã— L Ã— H) 31.5\" x 27.5\" x 58.5\"</p>', NULL, 'This top of the range floor-standing cutter is a must for manufacturers or pastry and kitchen chefs processing large volumes!\\nWith its bowl-base twin-blade assembly - a Robot-Coupe innovation - it is the ideal assistant in your kitchen. All preparations can be made by simply pressing a button: emulsions and sauces; mince meat and fish; chop onions, herbs and spices; grind nuts, chocolate or praline; knead dough.', NULL, '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ VERTICAL CUTTER MIXERS R30 A</p>\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ motor Yes</p>\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Power 7 HP</p>\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Voltage 3 phase 208 - 240 V</p>\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Speeds 1800 - 3600 rpm</p>\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Pulse Yes</p>\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-