(4015, 'Robot Coupe R60 Vertical Cutter Mixer', NULL, 'robot-coupe-r60-vertical-cutter-mixer-2', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0px\">â€¢ Robot Coupe R60 Vertical Cutter Mixer</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ 11,000W Induction motor</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Speed: 1500 - 3000 rpm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ IP65 control panel with digital timer</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Timer: From 0-15 minutes for consistency. Automatically repeats the previously set time</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Stainless steel control buttons: flush with the casing for easy cleaning and durability</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Indicator lights for user safety</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Pulse control for precision processing</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Polycarbonate see-through lid</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢Lid wiper allows you to monitor your preparation from start to finish</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Opening in the lid centre to add liquids or dry ingredients during processing</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Lid is designed to direct liquid back into the bowl when opened</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Lid rubber seal prevents liquid overflow</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Quick and easy to remove for cleaning</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Lid is dishwasher-safe</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ 60L stainless steel bowl with handles</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Tilting mechanism, at more than 90Â°, for effortless empyting of your preparation</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Removable, exclusive to Robot Coupe, for easy cleaning</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Smooth blade: 100% stainless-steel Bowl-base blade assembly for working small and large quantities. Dismountable and adjustable</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Frame: All Stainless steel construction:</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ 3 sturdy legs for stability and safety</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Compact footprint</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Easy to clean</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Wheels: 3 retractable wheels making it easier to move and allow cleaning of your production area</p>', NULL, 'Made in France\r\\nDimensions: W: 810 x D: 600 x H: 1400mm\r\\nWeight: 187 Kg\r\\n\r\\nPower: 3 phase (supplied without plug)\r\\nThis top of the range floor-standing cutter is a must for manufacturers or pastry and kitchen chefs processing large volumes!\r\\nWith its bowl-base twin-blade assembly - a Robot-Coupe innovation - it is the ideal assistant in your kitchen. All preparations can be made by simply pressing a button: emulsions and sauces; mince meat and fish; chop onions, herbs and spices; grind nuts, chocolate or praline; knead dough.', NULL, '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0px\">â€¢ Robot Coupe R60 Vertical Cutter Mixer</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ 11,000W Induction motor</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Speed: 1500 - 3000 rpm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ IP65 control panel with digital timer</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Timer: From 0-15 minutes for consistency. Automatically repeats the previously set time</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Stainless steel control buttons: flush with the casing for easy cleaning and durability</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Indicator lights for user safety</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Pulse control for precision processing</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Polycarbonate see-through lid</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢Lid wiper allows you to monitor your preparation from start to finish</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Opening in the lid centre to add liquids or dry ingredients during processing</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Lid is designed to direct liquid back into the bowl when opened</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Lid rubber seal prevents liquid overflow</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Quick and easy to remove for cleaning</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Lid is dishwasher-safe</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ 60L stainless steel bowl with handles</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Tilting mechanism, at more than 90Â°, for effortless empyting of your preparation</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Removable, exclusive to Robot Coupe, for easy cleaning</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Smooth blade: 100% stainless-steel Bowl-base blade assembly for working small and large quantities. Dismountable and adjustable</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Frame: All Stainless steel construction:</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ 3 sturdy legs for stability and safety</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Compact footprint</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Easy to clean</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0;padding-top: 0\">â€¢ Wheels: 3 retractable wheels making it easier to move and allow cleaning of your production area</p>', 108927.00, 15.00, 92587.95, 50, 0, 87, 88, 89, 57, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Cutter Mixer, FOOD PROCESSING, Kitchen Equipment, Special Offer', NULL, 'R60', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:29', '2026-04-18 14:51:33', NULL, 0),
(4016, 'Glo-Ray Aluminum Infrared Strip Heater (GRAH-24)', NULL, 'glo-ray-aluminum-infrared-strip-heater-grah-24-1', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Glo-Ray Aluminum Infrared Strip Heater (GRAH-24)</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Tubular metal heater rod.</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Single heater rod housing.</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Aluminum construction.</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Builtâ€in toggle control.</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ High wattage.</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Elec. Rating: 240v/50/1â€ph/500w/2.1A.</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Dimensions: 610 x 153 x 64 mm</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Gross weight: 3.6Kg.</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ GRAH-24/ HATCO/ USA</p>', NULL, 'The Glo-Ray Aluminum Infrared Strip Heater (GRAH-24) is a durable and efficient heating solution designed for commercial kitchens. Measuring 24 inches, it features an aluminum housing that enhances its durability and heat conduction. The infrared technology ensures even heat distribution, keeping food at optimal serving temperatures without drying it out. Ideal for pass-through stations, buffet lines, and other food service applications, this strip heater is both reliable and energy-efficient.', NULL, '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Glo-Ray Aluminum Infrared Strip Heater (GRAH-24)</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Tubular metal heater rod.</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Single heater rod housing.</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Aluminum construction.</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Builtâ€in toggle control.</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ High wattage.</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Elec. Rating: 240v/50/1â€ph/500w/