4a\r\\n. Net Weight: 122 Kg\r\\n. Dim: 830 x 740 x 2010mm (WxDxH)\r\\n. Digital : DIXELL / ITALY MADE .\r\\n. compressor : ASPERA / EMBRACO / EU made\r\\nGN650BT/G Made for MARIOT/ ISO9001, CE&amp;ROHS approved \"', 4923.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 51, 64, 65, 38, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Freezer & Chillers, Kitchen Equipment, REFRIGERATION LINE', NULL, 'GN650BT/G', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:29', '2026-04-18 14:51:33', NULL, 0),
