(4058, 'Blendtec Connoisseur 825 Professional Commercial Blender', NULL, 'blendtec-connoisseur-825-professional-commercial-blender-1', 'Blendtec Connoisseur 825 Professional Commercial Blender- Including, 2 x 1L Jars with Lid:\r\\n\r\\nThe Connoisseur 825 boasts industry-leading power and a wide range of state-of-the-art features designed to ensure speed, consistency, and quality with each and every order.\r\\n\r\\nDurable High-speed Motor\r\\n\r\\nPerfect for high-volume shops, the Connoisseur 825 is a workhorse built with longevity in mind. The 3.8 peak horsepower motor easily powers through the toughest ingredients, like ice and frozen fruit, without skipping a beat.\r\\n\r\\nPreprogrammed Cycles\r\\n\r\\nThe Connoisseur 825 includes 30 preprogrammed cycles that can blend your most popular recipes with perfect consistency. Each cycle shuts off automatically, freeing up operators for other tasks.\r\\n\r\\nSound Enclosure\r\\n\r\\nFor shops where noise is a consideration, the sound enclosure cuts down on blender noise, helping ensure an undisrupted atmosphere.\r\\n\r\\nFeatures include:\r\\n\r\\nMotor: 3.8 peak horsepower, 1825 watts, 15 amps\r\\nRecommended daily blends: 150+\r\\nProgram cycles: 30 preprogrammed cycles + Pulse\r\\nCountertop or In-Counter\r\\nColors: Black\r\\nHigh Volume, Low Noise\r\\nDimensions\r\\n\r\\nH: 18.7â€ (47.5 cm)\r\\nD: 9.0â€ (22.9 cm)\r\\nW: 9.0â€ (22.9 cm)\r\\n\r\\nWeight : 16.8 lbs (7.6 kg)', NULL, 'The Blendtec Connoisseur 825 Quiet Professional Commercial Blender boasts industry-leading power with features designed for Restaurants, Bars &amp; Coffee Shops. The Connoisseur 825 has 30 preprogrammed cycles and is a durable workhorse for high-volume F&amp;B outlets, delivering speed, consistency and quality.', NULL, 'Blendtec Connoisseur 825 Professional Commercial Blender- Including, 2 x 1L Jars with Lid:\r\\n\r\\nThe Connoisseur 825 boasts industry-leading power and a wide range of state-of-the-art features designed to ensure speed, consistency, and quality with each and every order.\r\\n\r\\nDurable High-speed Motor\r\\n\r\\nPerfect for high-volume shops, the Connoisseur 825 is a workhorse built with longevity in mind. The 3.8 peak horsepower motor easily powers through the toughest ingredients, like ice and frozen fruit, without skipping a beat.\r\\n\r\\nPreprogrammed Cycles\r\\n\r\\nThe Connoisseur 825 includes 30 preprogrammed cycles that can blend your most popular recipes with perfect consistency. Each cycle shuts off automatically, freeing up operators for other tasks.\r\\n\r\\nSound Enclosure\r\\n\r\\nFor shops where noise is a consideration, the sound enclosure cuts down on blender noise, helping ensure an undisrupted atmosphere.\r\\n\r\\nFeatures include:\r\\n\r\\nMotor: 3.8 peak horsepower, 1825 watts, 15 amps\r\\nRecommended daily blends: 150+\r\\nProgram cycles: 30 preprogrammed cycles + Pulse\r\\nCountertop or In-Counter\r\\nColors: Black\r\\nHigh Volume, Low Noise\r\\nDimensions\r\\n\r\\nH: 18.7â€ (47.5 cm)\r\\nD: 9.0â€ (22.9 cm)\r\\nW: 9.0â€ (22.9 cm)\r\\n\r\\nWeight : 16.8 lbs (7.6 kg)', 4850.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 70, 122, NULL, 7, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Blenders, COFFEE & BAR LINE, Kitchen Equipment', NULL, 'Connoisseur 825', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:29', '2026-04-18 14:51:33', NULL, 0),
