oking Area\r\\nâ–  179 L x 356 W x 100 H /VAT\r\\nâ–  Oil capacity: 20 LBS /VAT4\r\\n240V / 1 Phase / 1200 watts / 5 amps', 18443.00, 10.00, 16598.70, 50, 0, 17, 45, 46, 70, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Fryers, Kitchen Equipment, Special Offer', NULL, 'THEGF 50â€2C', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:30', '2026-04-18 14:51:33', NULL, 0),
(4061, 'Toastmaster GRIDDLE - THEGâ€24', NULL, 'toastmaster-griddle-thegâ€24-1', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Toastmaster GRIDDLE - THEGâ€24</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ GRIDDLE</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ Toastmaster (Middleby) Model No. THEGâ€24</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ HIGH EFFICIENCY GAS GRIDDLE</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ STANDARD FEATURES (HEG) :STANDARD FEATURES (MEG):\r\\nâ€¢ Stainless steel front, sides with aluminized rear bottom\r\\nâ€¢ Infrared ceramic atmospheric burner - no air blowers\r\\nâ€¢ Solid state temperature controller for each heating zone\r\\nâ€¢ Full automatic pilot ignition with flame loss detection\r\\nâ€¢ 1 inch-thick polish rolled steel plate\r\\nâ€¢ Side grease can at left and right\r\\nâ€¢ 3/4\" gas connection\r\\nâ€¢ Rests on 6\" caster wheels\r\\nâ€¢ Stainless steel front and sides with aluminized rear and bottom\r\\nâ€¢ Heavy-duty heating elements covering each heating zones\r\\nâ€¢ Solid state temperature controller for each heating zone\r\\nâ€¢ Mercury-free heat relay\r\\nâ€¢ 1 inch-thick polished rolled plate\r\\nâ€¢ Side grease can at left and right\r\\nâ€¢ Rests on 6\" caster wheels\r\\nâ€¢ Includes egg cooker hanger at rear splasher</p>', NULL, 'The Toastmaster THEGâ€24 Griddle is a durable and efficient countertop appliance designed for commercial kitchens. This gas-powered griddle features a 24-inch cooking surface, perfect for preparing a variety of foods such as pancakes, eggs, burgers, and more. Its robust stainless steel construction ensures longevity, while the precise temperature controls allow for consistent cooking results. The THEGâ€24 is equipped with easy-to-clean surfaces and grease management systems, making it an ideal choice for busy food service establishments seeking reliability and performance.', NULL, '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Toastmaster GRIDDLE - THEG