(4101, 'GAS RANGE 4 BURNERS ON GAS OVEN - G4SF65', NULL, 'gas-range-4-burners-on-gas-oven-g4sf65-2', 'GAS RANGE 4 BURNERS ON GAS OVEN\r\\nThe worktop is made of 304 stainless steel with a thickness of 1 mm, deep-drawn and watertight to avoid dirt infiltration, also thanks to the rounded edges and the molded recess which guarantees the containment of liquid and overflows.\r\\n. Oven with glass door, enamelled walls, cap. 4 grids 44x37. External dimensions - WxDxH (cm): 60 x 65 x 85\r\\n. Nr. burners 3.5 kW 2-6 kW * 2\r\\nGas oven (kW):2\r\\nTotal power (kW): 21\r\\nOven dimensions: 460 x 420 x 320 (mm)\r\\nVoltage: 230V 1N 50-60Hz\r\\nWeight (kg):63\r\\nVolume (m3): 0.6\r\\nDim: 600 x 650 x 850 mm\r\\nG4SF65 / MBM / Italy made.\r\\nINCLUDE ISO9001', NULL, 'G4SF65 Gas Range: The G4SF65 Gas Range is a versatile cooking appliance featuring four high-performance gas burners and a spacious gas oven. Designed for efficiency and precision, the burners provide even heat distribution for various cooking styles, from simmering to searing. The gas oven offers consistent baking and roasting results with easy-to-adjust temperature controls. With its durable construction and sleek design, the G4SF65 is perfect for both home kitchens and professional culinary environments, ensuring a reliable and enjoyable cooking experience.', NULL, 'GAS RANGE 4 BURNERS ON GAS OVEN\r\\nThe worktop is made of 304 stainless steel with a thickness of 1 mm, deep-drawn and watertight to avoid dirt infiltration, also thanks to the rounded edges and the molded recess which guarantees the containment of liquid and overflows.\r\\n. Oven with glass door, enamelled walls, cap. 4 grids 44x37. External dimensions - WxDxH (cm): 60 x 65 x 85\r\\n. Nr. burners 3.5 kW 2-6 kW * 2\r\\nGas oven (kW):2\r\\nTotal power (kW): 21\r\\nOven dimensions: 460 x 420 x 320 (mm)\r\\nVoltage: 230V 1N 50-60Hz\r\\nWeight (kg):63\r\\nVolume (m3): 0.6\r\\nDim: 600 x 650 x 850 mm\r\\nG4SF65 / MBM / Italy made.\r\\nINCLUDE ISO9001', 7198.73, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 17, 21, 22, 40, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Cooker, COOKING LINE, Kitchen Equipment, COOKING LINE', 'Cooker', 'G4SF65', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:30', '2026-04-18 14:51:34', NULL, 0),
