(4106, 'CAN SEALER MACHINE- MX-01', NULL, 'can-sealer-machine-mx-01-1', 'â€¢CAN SEALER MACHINE- MX-01\r\\nâ€¢MODEL: MX-01\r\\nâ€¢VOLTAGE: 220V\r\\nâ€¢POWER: 370W\r\\nâ€¢CAN INNER DIAMETER: 52MM\r\\nâ€¢CAN OUTER DIAMETER: 55MM\r\\nâ€¢CAN CAPACITY: 500ML-650ML\r\\nâ€¢PRODUCT SIZE: 255*455*608MM', NULL, '<strong>CAN SEALER MACHINE - MX-01</strong>\r\\n\r\\nThe MX-01 Can Sealer Machine is a robust and reliable solution designed for sealing a wide range of cans with precision and efficiency. Built with high-quality materials and advanced sealing technology, this machine ensures airtight and leak-proof seals, preserving the freshness and quality of your products. Ideal for small to medium-scale production, the MX-01 is easy to operate, maintain, and adjust for various can sizes. Whether you\'re in the food, beverage, or industrial sector, the MX-01 delivers consistent performance, making it an essential tool for your packaging needs.\r\\n\r\\n<strong>Key Features:</strong>\r\\n<ul>\r\\n 	<li><strong>High Efficiency:</strong> Seals cans quickly and accurately, increasing production speed.</li>\r\\n 	<li><strong>Versatility:</strong> Compatible with various can sizes and types.</li>\r\\n 	<li><strong>Durability:</strong> Constructed with premium-grade materials for long-lasting use.</li>\r\\n 	<li><strong>User-Friendly:</strong> Simple controls and easy maintenance for hassle-free operation.</li>\r\\n 	<li><strong>Compact Design:</strong> Space-saving design, perfect for any production environment.</li>\r\\n</ul>', NULL, 'â€¢CAN SEALER MACHINE- MX-01\r\\nâ€¢MODEL: MX-01\r\\nâ€¢VOLTAGE: 220V\r\\nâ€¢POWER: 370W\r\\nâ€¢CAN INNER DIAMETER: 52MM\r\\nâ€¢CAN OUTER DIAMETER: 55MM\r\\nâ€¢CAN CAPACITY: 500ML-650ML\r\\nâ€¢PRODUCT SIZE: 255*455*608MM', 5500.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 87, 91, 92, 38, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', NULL, NULL, 'MX-01', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:30', '2026-04-18 14:51:34', NULL, 0),
