\\n</div>', NULL, '<strong> Coffee Machine La Cimbali - M200 DT/2 GT1 4P 2VAP. BLACK</strong>\r\\nSpecification : La Cimbali has a new\r\\nflagship: M200. Designed to steal\r\\nthe show. A design icon that defines\r\\na spaceâ€™s status. A newly designed\r\\nproject that combines passion for\r\\nhigh-quality coffee with the\r\\nrationale of functional and smart\r\\nergonomics.\r\\nâ€¢ GT1 System\r\\nâ€¢Adjustable water temperature\r\\nâ€¢Steam wand Cold Touch\r\\nâ€¢ PGS\r\\nâ€¢Smart Boilerâ€¢ Mixed water\r\\nâ€¢Bluetooth\r\\nâ€¢ Green Machine\r\\nâ€¢ USBPort\r\\nâ€¢ WiFi connectivity embedded\r\\nâ€¢New stainless steel portafilters\r\\nâ€¢Cold Touch steam wands: 2\r\\nâ€¢ Hot water wand: 1\r\\nâ€¢ Hot water selections:3\r\\nâ€¢ Service boiler capacity (Litres): 7\r\\nâ€¢Independent coffee boilers: 2\r\\nâ€¢Independent coffee boilers capacity(cc): 600\r\\nâ€¢ Coffee boiler heater (W):800\r\\nâ€¢ Electrical cup warmer (3 temperature settings)\r\\nâ€¢ Dimension (mm): W887 x D649 x H516\r\\nâ€¢ Weight(kg): 70\r\\nâ€¢ Power at 380-415V3N~50/60Hz (W): 6000-7000W', 38500.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 101, NULL, NULL, 34, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Coffee Machines, Kitchen Equipment', NULL, 'M200 DT/2 GT1 4P 2VAP. BLACK', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:31', '2026-04-16 09:12:25', NULL, 0),
(4154, 'Coffee Machine La Cimbali - M100RE DT/2 GTI 3P VA BLACK', NULL, 'coffee-machine-la-cimbali-m100re-dt/2-gti-3p-va-black-1', '<strong>Coffee Machine La Cimbali - M100RE DT/2 GTI 3P VA BLACK</strong>\r\\nSpecification : M100 Attiva range,\r\\nwith its new thermal system GTA,\r\\ninterfaces, design, ergonomics\r\\nfeatures and accessories guarantee\r\\nmaximum flexibility and has been\r\\ndesigned to rewrite the rules of an\r\\nentire category and to pave the way\r\\nfor a new generation of professional\r\\nmachinesGTA System.\r\\nAdjustable water temperature.\r\\nSteam wand cold touch.\r\\nPGS.\r\\nSmart Boiler.\r\\nMixed waterBluetooth.\r\\nGreen machineUSBPort.\r\\nCold Touch Steam wands: 2Hot water\r\\nwand: 1Hot water\r\\nselections: 3Service boiler\r\\ncapacity (Litres): 10Independent\r\\ncoffee boilers: 2Independent coffee boilers\r\\ncapacity (cc): 400Coffee boiler\r\\nheater (W): 800Electrical cup warmer (3 temperature settings)\r\\nWidth x Depth x Height (mm): 832X567X582Weight (kg): 89', NULL, 'La Cimbali M100RE DT/2 GTI Coffee Machine\r\\n\r\\nThe La Cimbali M100RE DT/2 GTI delivers precision and performance with 3 programmable profiles, advanced GTI technology, and a sophisticated black finishâ€”ideal for professional coffee brewing.', NULL, '<strong>Coffee Machine La Cimbali - M100RE DT/2 GTI 3P VA BLACK</strong>\r\\nSpecification : M100 Attiva range,\r\\nwith its new thermal system GTA,\r\\ninterfaces, design, ergonomics\r\\nfeatures and accessories guarantee\r\\nmaximum flexibility and has been\r\\ndesigned to rewrite the rules of an\r\\nentire category and to pave the way\r\\nfor a new generation of professional\r\\nmachinesGTA System.\r\\nAdjustable water temperature.\r\\nSteam wand cold touch.\r\\nPGS.\r\\nSmart Boiler.\r\\nMixed waterBluetooth.\r\\nGreen machineUSBPort.\r\\nCold Touch Steam wands: 2Hot water\r\\nwand: 1Hot water\r\\nselections: 3Service boiler\r\\ncapacity (Litres): 10Independent\r\\ncoffee boilers: 2Independent coffee boil