(4159, 'Full Automatic Line Arabic Bread - BIMATIC / LEBANON', NULL, 'full-automatic-line-arabic-bread-bimatic-/-lebanon-1', '\"Full Automatic Line Arabic Bread\r\\n- It is a fully automatic line for producing the Arabic Lebanese Bread.\r\\n- It can be a single, double, triple, and quadrupled , octa output to satisfy any customer need concerning both productive capacity and size.\r\\n- It can produce a range between 500 Loaves up to 20000 Loaves per hour with a diameter between 15 cm to 38 cm.\r\\n- These lines are adopted for supermarkets, big restaurants and bakeries. Space needed for line installation varies from 70-240 mÂ².\r\\nFull Automatic Line Arabic Bread Composed of:\r\\n- Dough Divider\r\\n- Primary Proofer\r\\n- Dough Flattener\r\\n- Final Proofer\r\\n- Tunnel Oven\r\\n- Cooling Conveyor\r\\nBIMATIC / LEBANON \"', NULL, '<strong>Full Automatic Line for Arabic Bread - BIMATIC / Lebanon</strong>\r\\nEfficient and reliable, BIMATIC\'s Full Automatic Line for Arabic Bread offers seamless production with advanced technology. Designed in Lebanon, this system ensures consistent quality, high capacity, and minimal labor requirements, making it ideal for modern bakeries.', NULL, '\"Full Automatic Line Arabic Bread\r\\n- It is a fully automatic line for producing the Arabic Lebanese Bread.\r\\n- It can be a single, double, triple, and quadrupled , octa output to satisfy any customer need concerning both productive capacity and size.\r\\n- It can produce a range between 500 Loaves up to 20000 Loaves per hour with a diameter between 15 cm to 38 cm.\r\\n- These lines are adopted for supermarkets, big restaurants and bakeries. Space needed for line installation varies from 70-240 mÂ².\r\\nFull Automatic Line Arabic Bread Composed of:\r\\n- Dough Divider\r\\n- Primary Proofer\r\\n- Dough Flattener\r\\n- Final Proofer\r\\n- Tunnel Oven\r\\n- Cooling Conveyor\r\\nBIMATIC / LEBANON \"', 350075.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 17, NULL, NULL, 86, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Bread Maker, Kitchen Equipment', NULL, 'BIMATIC / LEBANON', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:31', '2026-04-10 06:40:17', NULL, 0),
(4160, 'Dough Divider - PDD-S', NULL, 'dough-divider-pdd-s-1', '\"Dough Divider PDD-S\r\\nDough Weight (grams): 50-150\r\\n- Pies dough divider is used to divide dough into dough balls.\r\\n- The dough weight ranges due to purpose and demand.\r\\n- It consists of aluminum extruding spiral shaft that is compatible with food grade policy.\r\\n- It is relatively silent in-operation.\r\\n- It is a mobilized unit that can be moved from one location to another.\r\\nWeight: 125 kg\r\\nDim: 120 x 85 x 83 cm\r\\nModel: PDD-S / BIMATIC / LEBANON \"', NULL, '<strong>Dough Divider - PDD-S</strong>\r\\nThe PDD-S Dough Divider ensures precise and consistent dough portioning for optimal baking results. Engineered for efficiency and durability, it is perfect for high-volume bakeries, delivering uniform pieces with minimal waste and easy operation.', NULL, '\"Dough Divider PDD-S\r\\nDough Weight (grams): 50-150\r\\n- Pies dough divider is used to divide dough into dough balls.\r\\n- The dough weight ranges due to purpose and demand.\r\\n- It consists of aluminum extruding spiral shaft that is compatible with food grade policy.\r\\n- It is relatively silent in-operation.\r\\n- It is a mobilized unit that can be moved from one location to another.\r\\nWeight: 125 kg\r\\nDim: 120 x 85 x 83 cm\r\\nModel: PDD-S / BIMATIC / LEBANON \"', 10281.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 86, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', NULL, NULL, 'PDD-S', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:31', '2026-04-09 11:54:20', NULL, 0),
(4161, 'Dough Flattener - PDF-IN', NULL, 'dough-flattener-pdf-in-1', '\"Dough Flattener PDF-IN\r\\n- Pies dough flattener is used to flatten the divided dough into circular dough plates. \r\\n- It flattens from 10-30 cm or 10-40cm with a thickness that ranges from 2-7 mm. \r\\n- It consists of hard chromate cylinders that are compatible with food grade policy. \r\\n- It is relatively silent in-operation. \r\\n- It is a mobilized unit that can be moved from one location to another. \r\\nWeight (Kg) : 110\r\\nDim: 150 x 60 x 120 cm\r\\nModel: PDF-IN / BIMATIC / LEBANON \"', NULL, '<strong>Dough Flattener - PDF-IN</strong>\r\\nThe PDF-IN Dough Flattener is designed for perfect dough sheet preparation with precision and ease. Ideal for bakeries, it delivers uniform thickness, enhancing efficiency and ensuring consistent quality for a wide range of baked products.', NULL, '\"Dough Flattener PDF-IN\r\\n- Pies dough flattener is used to flatten the divided dough into circular dough plates. \r\\n- It flattens from 10-30 cm or 10-40cm with a thickness that ranges from 2-7 mm. \r\\n- It consists of hard chromate cylinders that are compatible with food grade policy. \r\\n- It is relatively silent in-operation. \r\\n- It is a mobilized unit that can be moved from one location to another. \r\\nWeight (Kg) : 110\r\\nDim: 150 x 60 x 120 cm\r\\nModel: PDF-IN / BIMATIC / LEBANON \"', 8954.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 86, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', NULL, NULL, 'PDF-IN', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:31', '2026-04-09 11:54:20', NULL, 0),
