(4167, 'COMMERCIAL BLENDER MIXER W/SOUND PROOFER - FTA-901', NULL, 'commercial-blender-mixer-w/sound-proofer-fta-901-2', 'COMMERCIAL BLENDER MIXER W/SOUND PROOFER Unbreakable Polycarbonate Jar * Variable Speed and Multi Function * on/off switches, w/ manual adjustable speed control. * color: BLACK * Capacity: 1.6 ltr [2000 C.C] * Voltage: 220-240 V / 50-60 hz * speed: 35000 r/min. * Power: 1800 V * N.W: 5.0 kgs G.W: 5.5 kgs * Dim: 200 x 230 x 520 mm (WxDxH) FTA-901', NULL, '<strong>Commercial Blender Mixer w/ Sound Proofer - FTA-901</strong>\r\\nEffortlessly blend smoothies, shakes, and more with the FTA-901 Commercial Blender Mixer. Designed with a powerful motor and a built-in sound proofer, it delivers high-performance blending with minimal noise. Ideal for cafes, restaurants, and professional kitchens seeking efficiency and convenience.', NULL, 'COMMERCIAL BLENDER MIXER W/SOUND PROOFER Unbreakable Polycarbonate Jar * Variable Speed and Multi Function * on/off switches, w/ manual adjustable speed control. * color: BLACK * Capacity: 1.6 ltr [2000 C.C] * Voltage: 220-240 V / 50-60 hz * speed: 35000 r/min. * Power: 1800 V * N.W: 5.0 kgs G.W: 5.5 kgs * Dim: 200 x 230 x 520 mm (WxDxH) FTA-901', 1050.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 107, 111, NULL, 38, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Blenders, COFFEE & BAR LINE, Kitchen Equipment', NULL, 'FTA-901', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:31', '2026-04-18 14:51:34', NULL, 0),
