(4171, 'CUTTER MIXER VARIABLE SPEED - L6DIV VARIABLE', NULL, 'cutter-mixer-variable-speed-l6div-variable-2', '\"CUTTER MIXER VARIABLE SPEED\r\\nCap: 6 ltrs\r\\nLiquid cap. 99%\r\\n- IP65 Controls\r\\n- Induction motor\r\\n- Dishwasher safe\r\\n- Thermal relay\r\\n- HummusMaster\r\\n- High power, induction motor.\r\\n- Power: 0,75 kW\r\\n1.1 kW\r\\n- Speed: 600-3500 rpm.\r\\n- Volts: 110V 60Hz 1ph\r\\n- Dim: 255 x 502 x 338 mm\r\\nModel: L6DIV VARIABLE / CAPINOX / KITPRO / TURKEY\"', NULL, '<strong>Cutter Mixer Variable Speed - L6DIV Variable</strong>\r\\nThe L6DIV Variable Cutter Mixer is a compact and versatile appliance with adjustable speed settings for precise food preparation. Ideal for chopping, blending, and emulsifying, its durable construction ensures long-lasting performance. Perfect for professional kitchens requiring control and flexibility in processing smaller quantities.', NULL, '\"CUTTER MIXER VARIABLE SPEED\r\\nCap: 6 ltrs\r\\nLiquid cap. 99%\r\\n- IP65 Controls\r\\n- Induction motor\r\\n- Dishwasher safe\r\\n- Thermal relay\r\\n- HummusMaster\r\\n- High power, induction motor.\r\\n- Power: 0,75 kW\r\\n1.1 kW\r\\n- Speed: 600-3500 rpm.\r\\n- Volts: 110V 60Hz 1ph\r\\n- Dim: 255 x 502 x 338 mm\r\\nModel: L6DIV VARIABLE / CAPINOX / KITPRO / TURKEY\"', 4539.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 17, NULL, NULL, 10, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Cutter Mixer, FOOD PROCESSING, Kitchen Equipment', NULL, 'L6DIV VARIABLE', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:31', '2026-04-10 06:40:17', NULL, 0),
(4172, 'CUTTER MIXER VARIABLE SPEED - L9DIV VARIABLE', NULL, 'cutter-mixer-variable-speed-l9div-variable-2', '\"CUTTER MIXER VARIABLE SPEED\r\\nCap: 9 ltrs\r\\nLiquid cap. 99%\r\\n- IP65 Controls\r\\n- Induction motor\r\\n- Dishwasher safe\r\\n- Thermal relay\r\\n- HummusMaster\r\\n- High power, induction motor.\r\\n- Power: 1,1 kW\r\\n1.5 kW\r\\n- Speed: 600-3500 rpm.\r\\n- Volts: 110V 60Hz 1ph\r\\n- Dim: 255 x 562 x 338 mm\r\\nModel: L9DIV VARIABLE / CAPINOX / KITPRO / TURKEY\"', NULL, '<strong>Cutter Mixer Variable Speed - L9DIV Variable</strong>\r\\nThe L9DIV Variable Cutter Mixer offers advanced versatility with adjustable speed settings, allowing for precise control over chopping, mixing, and emulsifying. Designed for high-capacity tasks, it ensures efficient processing with consistent results. Its robust build and user-friendly features make it a reliable choice for professional kitchens, enhancing productivity and precision in food preparation.', NULL, '\"CUTTER MIXER VARIABLE SPEED\r\\nCap: 9 ltrs\r\\nLiquid cap. 99%\r\\n- IP65 Controls\r\\n- Induction motor\r\\n- Dishwasher safe\r\\n- Thermal relay\r\\n- HummusMaster\r\\n- High power, induction motor.\r\\n- Power: 1,1 kW\r\\n1.5 kW\r\\n- Speed: 600-3500 rpm.\r\\n- Volts: 110V 60Hz 1ph\r\\n- Dim: 255 x 562 x 338 mm\r\\nModel: L9DIV VARIABLE / CAPINOX / KITPRO / TURKEY\"', 5310.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 17, NULL, NULL, 10, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Cutter Mixer, FOOD PROCESSING, Kitchen Equipment', NULL, 'L9DIV VARIABLE', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:31', '2026-04-10 06:40:17', NULL, 0),
(4173, 'CUTTER MIXER VARIABLE SPEED - L12DIV VARIABLE', NULL, 'cutter-mixer-variable-speed-l12div-variable-2', '\"CUTTER MIXER VARIABLE SPEED\r\\nCap: 12 ltrs\r\\nLiquid cap. 99%\r\\n- IP65 Controls\r\\n- Induction motor\r\\n- Dishwasher safe\r\\n- Thermal relay\r\\n- HummusMaster\r\\n- High power, induction motor.\r\\n- Power: 1,5 kW\r\\n2.2 kW\r\\n- Speed: 600-3500 rpm.\r\\n- Volts: 110V 60Hz 1ph\r\\n- Dim: 255 x 642 x 368 mm\r\\nModel: L12DIV VARIABLE /CAPINOX / KITPRO / TURKEY\"', NULL, '<strong>Cutter Mixer Variable Speed - L12DIV Variable</strong>\r\\nThe L12DIV Variable Cutter Mixer is a high-capacity, versatile kitchen appliance designed for precision and efficiency. With variable speed control, it offers optimal performance for chopping, mixing, and emulsifying a wide range of ingredients. Built for durability and ease of use, it is perfect for large-scale food preparation in professional kitchens, ensuring consistent results and enhanced productivity.', NULL, '\"CUTTER MIXER VARIABLE SPEED\r\\nCap: 12 ltrs\r\\nLiquid cap. 99%\r\\n- IP65 Controls\r\\n- Induction motor\r\\n- Dishwasher safe\r\\n- Thermal relay\r\\n- HummusMaster\r\\n- High power, induction motor.\r\\n- Power: 1,5 kW\r\\n2.2 kW\r\\n- Speed: 600-3500 rpm.\r\\n- Volts: 110V 60Hz 1ph\r\\n- Dim: 255 x 642 x 368 mm\r\\nModel: L12DIV VARIABLE /CAPINOX / KITPRO / TURKEY\"', 5999.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 17, NULL, NULL, 10, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Cutter Mixer, FOOD PROCESSING, Kitchen Equipment', NULL, 'L12DIV VARIABLE', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:31', '2026-04-10 06:40:17', NULL, 0),
(4174, 'CUTTER MIXER VARIABLE SPEED SCRAPER - L20IV VARIABLE', NULL, 'cutter-mixer-variable-speed-scraper-l20iv-variable-2', '\"CUTTER MIXER VARIABLE SPEED SCRAPER\r\\nCap: 20 ltrs\r\\nLiquid cap. 99%\r\\n- IP65 Controls\r\\n- Induction motor   \r\\n- Dishwasher safe   \r\\n- Thermal relay   \r\\n- HummusMaster\r\\n- High power, induction motor.\r\\n- Power: 2,2 kW\r\\n- Speed:  600-3000 rpm.\r\\n- Volts: 220V 1ph\r\\n- Dim: 731 x 482 x 1092 mm\r\\nModel: L20IV VARIABLE /CAPINOX /  KITPRO / TURKEY\"\r\\n', NULL, 'Cutter Mixer Variable Speed Scraper - L20IV Variable\r\\nThe L20IV Variable Cutter Mixer with Scraper is a high-performance kitchen appliance designed for precision and efficiency. Featuring adjustable speed control and an integrated scraper, it ensures thorough mixing and chopping, even with thick or sticky ingredients. Built for heavy-duty use, it is ideal for large-scale food preparation in professional kitchens, offering consistency, durability, and ease of use for optimal results.', NULL, '\"CUTTER MIXER VARIABLE SPEED SCRAPER\r\\nCap: 20 ltrs\r\\nLiquid cap. 99%\r\\n- IP65 Controls\r\\n- Induction motor   \r\\n- Dishwasher safe   \r\\n- Thermal relay   \r\\n- HummusMaster\r\\n- High power, induction motor.\r\\n- Power: 2,2 kW\r\\n- Speed:  600-3000 rpm.\r\\n- Volts: 220V 1ph\r\\n- Dim: 731 x 482 x 1092 mm\r\\nModel: L20IV VARIABLE /CAPINOX /  KITPRO / TURKEY\"\r\\n', 11350.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 17, NULL, NULL, 10, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Cutter Mixer, FOOD PROCESSING, Kitchen Equipment', NULL, 'L20IV VARIABLE', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:31', '2026-04-10 06:40:17', NULL, 0),
(4175, 'CUTTER MIXER VARIABLE SPEED SCRAPER - L30IV VARIABLE', NULL, 'cutter-mixer-variable-speed-scraper-l30iv-variable-2', '\"CUTTER MIXER VARIABLE SPEED SCRAPER\r\\nCap: 30 ltrs\r\\nLiquid cap. 99%\r\\n- IP65 Controls\r\\n- Induction motor   \r\\n- Dishwasher safe   \r\\n- Thermal relay   \r\\n- HummusMaster\r\\n- High power, induction motor.\r\\n- Power:5.5 kW\r\\n- Speed:  600-3000 rpm.\r\\n- Volts: 380V 3ph\r\\n- Dim: 730 x 480 x 1090 mm\r\\nModel: L30IV VARIABLE /CAPINOX /  KITPRO / TURKEY\"\r\\n', NULL, '<strong>Cutter Mixer Variable Speed Scraper - L30IV Variable</strong>\r\\nThe L30IV Variable Cutter Mixer with Scraper is a top-tier kitchen appliance designed for heavy-duty food processing. With variable speed settings and a built-in scraper, it ensures thorough and consistent mixing, chopping, and emulsifying, even with the most challenging ingredients. Its high-capacity design and durable construction make it perfect for large-scale commercial kitchens, delivering efficiency, precision, and reliability in every task.', NULL, '\"CUTTER MIXER VARIABLE SPEED SCRAPER\r\\nCap: 30 ltrs\r\\nLiquid cap. 99%\r\\n- IP65 Controls\r\\n- Induction motor   \r\\n- Dishwasher safe   \r\\n- Thermal relay   \r\\n- HummusMaster\r\\n- High power, induction motor.\r\\n- Power:5.5 kW\r\\n- Speed:  600-3000 rpm.\r\\n- Volts: 380V 3ph\r\\n- Dim: 730 x 480 x 1090 mm\r\\nModel: L30IV VARIABLE /CAPINOX /  KITPRO / TURKEY\"\r\\n', 17025.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 17, NULL, NULL, 10, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Cutter Mixer, FOOD PROCESSING, Kitchen Equipment', NULL, 'L30IV VARIABLE', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:31', '2026-04-10 06:40:17', NULL, 0),
(4176, 'ELECTRIC OVEN - MA/18-02-00-01', NULL, 'electric-oven-ma/18-02-00-01-1', '<strong>ELECTRIC OVEN - MA/18-02-00-01</strong>\r\\n. Capacity: 7 pizzas Ã¸33cm\r\\n- The EN-100 oven is an electric oven, but with a traditional dome shape made of a special highly refractory cement.\r\\n- The dome has a special internal design that improves heat circulation.\r\\n- The rotating bedplate is made of natural stone and allows pizzas (and more) to be cooked evenly, even under the harshest working conditions.\r\\n- The EN-100 oven represents an innovative yet user-friendly oven.\r\\n- The heat transmission modes: conduction - convection and radiation have been properly implemented, developed and managed with a state-of-the-art control (PID).\r\\n- Voltage: 380-415 V 3N 50/60 Hz\r\\n- Max kW: 21 kW\r\\n- Max temperature: 450Â°C\r\\n- Mouth opening: 530 X 220 mm\r\\n- Net / Gross Weight: 890 / 950 kg\r\\n- Dim: 1580 x 1820 x 1920 mm.\r\\nMA/18-02-00-01 / PASTALINE / Italy made.\"', NULL, '<strong>ELECTRIC OVEN - MA/18-02-00-01</strong>\r\\nThe EN-100 oven is an electric oven, but with a traditional dome shape made of a special highly refractory cement.\r\\nThe dome has a special internal design that improves heat circulation.\r\\nThe rotating bedplate is made of natural stone and allows pizzas (and more) to be cooked evenly, even under the harshest working conditions.\r\\n\r\\nThe EN-100 oven represents an innovative yet user-friendly oven. The heat transmission modes: conduction - convection and radiation have been properly implemented, developed and managed with a state-of-the-art control (PID).\r\\n\r\\nYou will be able to perfectly integrate the new EN-100 oven in your pizzeria or franchise; choose the finish of the covering from the many colours available, both normal and metallic.\r\\n\r\\nIf you prefer a more classic look, you can have EN-100 covered with mosaic tiles in a wide range of shades and colours. If, on the other hand, you want a minimalist, almost invisible oven, the solution for you is one integrated in the wall!', NULL, '<strong>ELECTRIC OVEN - MA/18-02-00-01</strong>\r\\n. Capacity: 7 pizzas Ã¸33cm\r\\n- The EN-100 oven is an electric oven, but with a traditional dome shape made of a special highly refractory cement.\r\\n- The dome has a special internal design that improves heat circulation.\r\\n- The rotating bedplate is made of natural stone and allows pizzas (and more) to be cooked evenly, even under the harshest working conditions.\r\\n- The EN-100 oven represents an innovative yet user-friendly oven.\r\\n- The heat transmission modes: conduction - convection and radiation have been properly implemented, developed and managed with a state-of-the-art control (PID).\r\\n- Voltage: 380-415 V 3N 50/60 Hz\r\\n- Max kW: 21 kW\r\\n- Max temperature: 450Â°C\r\\n- Mouth opening: 530 X 220 mm\r\\n- Net / Gross Weight: 890 / 950 kg\r\\n- Dim: 1580 x 1820 x 1920 mm.\r\\nMA/18-02-00-01 / PASTALINE / Italy made.\"', 80784.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, 91, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Bakery Oven, Kitchen Equipment', NULL, 'MA/18-02-00-01', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:31', '2026-04-16 09:12:26', NULL, 0),
(4177, 'DOUGH ROUNDER - MA/05-04-00-01', NULL, 'dough-rounder-ma/05-04-00-01-1', '<strong>DOUGH ROUNDER - MA/05-04-00-01</strong>\r\\n. Hourly production: 2400 portions/h\r\\n- Its allows you to transform all portions of dough from 20 g to 1000 g into balls. Without having to make adjustments or replace parts.\r\\n- The dough portions are introduced through the upper mouth of the rounder.\r\\n- The dough pieces are then rolled through the helical rounding system (internal spiral) and fed to the upper stainless steel output shelf in perfectly rolled balls, ready to be placed and stored in your dough bins.\r\\n- Rounder with all-stainless steel body.\r\\n- Disassembly and cleaning of the device is quick and easy.\r\\n- Voltage: 230 V / 50 Hz\r\\n- Power : 370 (W)\r\\n- Net / Gross Weight: 65 / 77 kg\r\\n- Dim: 350 x 540 x 850 mm.\r\\nMA/05-04-00-01 / PASTALINE / Italy made.\"', NULL, '<strong>DOUGH ROUNDER - MA/05-04-00-01</strong>\r\\n<em>Everything is simpler!</em>\r\\nSIMPLE AND ALWAYS READY FOR USE\r\\nSAFE AND RELIABLE\r\\nELIMINATES REPETITIVE MOVEMENTS\r\\nThe KALI rounder is capable of rounding dough portions ranging from 20g to 1000g without requiring any adjustment or the replacement of any parts. The KALI rounder is designed for use with various different types of dough, as follows:\r\\n\r\\nPizza dough: spiral A with 60-ridge cylinder\r\\nBread dough: spiral B with either 4-ridge or 12-ridge cylinder\r\\nVery moist and greasy mixes: Teflon-coated spiral B with 12-ridge cylinder\r\\n\r\\nThe technical solution whereby the dough only comes into contact\r\\nwith the spiral and cylinder enables the KALI rounder to comply with European and American health regulations (NSF and ETL Sanitation).\r\\n\r\\nThe innovative cooling technology, whereby the pressure in the mo- tor housing is reduced, helps to keep the dough portions being processed at room temperature in both in the spiral and the cylin- der.This cooling solution enables the transmission components to work for long periods without any maintenance.', NULL, '<strong>DOUGH ROUNDER - MA/05-04-00-01</strong>\r\\n. Hourly production: 2400 portions/h\r\\n- Its allows you to transform all portions of dough from 20 g to 1000 g into balls. Without having to make adjustments or replace parts.\r\\n- The dough portions are introduced through the upper mouth of the rounder.\r\\n- The dough pieces are then rolled through the helical rounding system (internal spiral) and fed to the upper stainless steel output shelf in perfectly rolled balls, ready to be placed and stored in your dough bins.\r\\n- Rounder with all-stainless steel body.\r\\n- Disassembly and cleaning of the device is quick and easy.\r\\n- Voltage: 230 V / 50 Hz\r\\n- Power : 370 (W)\r\\n- Net / Gross Weight: 65 / 77 kg\r\\n- Dim: 350 x 540 x 850 mm.\r\\nMA/05-04-00-01 / PASTALINE / Italy made.\"', 17477.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 91, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', NULL, NULL, 'MA/05-04-00-01', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:31', '2026-04-09 11:54:20', NULL, 0);
