(4178, 'TOP pizza rolling mill 45 cm GIOTTO D45 - MA/10-00-00-02', NULL, 'top-pizza-rolling-mill-45-cm-giotto-d45-ma/10-00-00-02-1', '\"TOP pizza rolling mill 45 cm GIOTTO D45\r\\n. Diameter 45 cm\r\\n. Min/max dough weight: 30-800g\r\\n. Pasta weight: 30 to 800g\r\\n. Outlet diameter (cm): 10 to 45 cm\r\\n- Pizza rolling mill with two adjustable oblique rollers that allow you to obtain the desired thickness with millimeter precision.\r\\n- This moulder is designed to roll out and extend cold dough for pizza bases, breads, pastas, cakes.\r\\n- Made with specific materials to be in contact with food products: AISI 304 stainless steel and certified plastics.\r\\n- Pizza sheeter ergonomically designed to facilitate the activity carried out by the operator and make cleaning easier at the end of use.\r\\n- The underside of the appliance is accessible for cleaning without handling.\r\\n- Voltage: 220 V / 50 Hz\r\\n- Power : 0.37 kW\r\\n- Net / Gross Weight: 35.8 / 39 kg\r\\n- Dim: 520 x 290 x H720/750 mm (30mm feet)\r\\nMA/10-00-00-02 / PASTALINE / Italy made.\"', NULL, '<strong>TOP pizza rolling mill 45 cm GIOTTO D45 - MA/10-00-00-02</strong>\r\\nThe Giotto D30 and D45 dough sheeters are designed to process dough for pizzas, breads, flat- breads, â€œfocacciaâ€ bread, cakes, samoosas, etc.\r\\n\r\\nManufactured entirely from stainless steel, with a detailed framework, these machines are equipped with foodstuff-grade resin rollers that comply with the most stringent workplace health and safety regulations.Thanks to the suction-pad feet supplied as standard equipment, the dough sheeters can easily be repositioned on the worktop in a safe and stable manner.The Giotto D30 and D45 dough sheeters enable the operator to work quickly and accurately, both when selecting the dough-thickness for processing purposes and when disassembling the rollers for cleaning purposes.Neither of these dough sheeters requires any formal day-to-day maintenance whatsoever.The Giotto D30 and D45 dough sheeters with two pair of rollers and a specially inclined lower pair of rollers enable the user to roll out dough circles up to 30 and 45cm in diameter respectively.', NULL, '\"TOP pizza rolling mill 45 cm GIOTTO D45\r\\n. Diameter 45 cm\r\\n. Min/max dough weight: 30-800g\r\\n. Pasta weight: 30 to 800g\r\\n. Outlet diameter (cm): 10 to 45 cm\r\\n- Pizza rolling mill with two adjustable oblique rollers that allow you to obtain the desired thickness with millimeter precision.\r\\n- This moulder is designed to roll out and extend cold dough for pizza bases, breads, pastas, cakes.\r\\n- Made with specific materials to be in contact with food products: AISI 304 stainless steel and certified plastics.\r\\n- Pizza sheeter ergonomically designed to facilitate the activity carried out by the operator and make cleaning easier at the end of use.\r\\n- The underside of the appliance is accessible for cleaning without handling.\r\\n- Voltage: 220 V / 50 Hz\r\\n- Power : 0.37 kW\r\\n- Net / Gross Weight: 35.8 / 39 kg\r\\n- Dim: 520 x 290 x H720/750 mm (30mm feet)\r\\nMA/10-00-00-02 / PASTALINE / Italy made.\"', 7200.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 87, 102, NULL, 91, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Rolling Machine', NULL, 'MA/10-00-00-02', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:31', '2026-04-18 14:51:34', NULL, 0),
(4179, 'IDEA TEMPERING MACHINE - MA/17-00-00-01', NULL, 'idea-tempering-machine-ma/17-00-00-01-1', '<strong>IDEA TEMPERING MACHINE - MA/17-00-00-01</strong>\r\\n. Tank capacity: Max 10 Lt\r\\n- IDEA is a device for melting and cooling chocolate.\r\\n- Tempering machine Idea utilises â€œBain Marieâ€ technology, this is ideal for the chocolate industry as well as pastry, ice cream, and similar sectors. Idea is patented for:\r\\n- The design of the tank for processing small and medium quantities.\r\\n- The integrated temperature control system Idea is equipped with a removable metal flap that ensures perfect mixing of the chocolate as it melts.\r\\n- Voltage: 220 V / 50 Hz\r\\n- Power : 1.65 Kw\r\\n- Temperature Max: 85Â° C\r\\n- Net / Gross Weight: 29 / 34 kg\r\\n- Dim: 520 x 480 x 530 mm\r\\nMA/17-00-00-01 / PASTALINE / Italy made.\"', NULL, '<strong>IDEA TEMPERING MACHINE - MA/17-00-00-01 </strong>\r\\nIDEA is a defroster and cooler that utilises â€œBain Marieâ€ technology and is not only ideal for the chocolate manufacturing sector but also for confectionery kitchens, ice-cream parlours, etc.IDEA has been patented due to:\r\\n\r\\nthe design of its tray, which is perfect for processing small to medium-size batches\r\\nits integrated temperature control system\r\\nIDEA offers targeted solutions that make it SIMPLE, EASY and CONVENIENT to use in any workshop, even for small batches or limited production runs.', NULL, '<strong>IDEA TEMPERING MACHINE - MA/17-00-00-01</strong>\r\\n. Tank capacity: Max 10 Lt\r\\n- IDEA is a device for melting and cooling chocolate.\r\\n- Tempering machine Idea utilises â€œBain Marieâ€ technology, this is ideal for the chocolate industry as well as pastry, ice cream, and similar sectors. Idea is patented for:\r\\n- The design of the tank for processing small and medium quantities.\r\\n- The integrated temperature control system Idea is equipped with a removable metal flap that ensures perfect mixing of the chocolate as it melts.\r\\n- Voltage: 220 V / 50 Hz\r\\n- Power : 1.65 Kw\r\\n- Temperature Max: 85Â° C\r\\n- Net / Gross Weight: 29 / 34 kg\r\\n- Dim: 520 x 480 x 530 mm\r\\nMA/17-00-00-01 / PASTALINE / Italy made.\"', 21542.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 91, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', NULL, NULL, 'MA/17-00-00-01', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:31', '2026-04-09 11:54:20', NULL, 0),
(4180, 'DOUGH KNEADING MACHINE - HY.05.k', NULL, 'dough-kneading-machine-hy05k-1', '\"<strong>DOUGH KNEADING MACHINE</strong>\r\\n- flour cap : 30 kg.\r\\n- capacity : 50 ltr.\r\\n- Motor Power:0.75 Kw 1400 rpm / 220V - 380V / 50-60 Hz\r\\n- Bowl dim(diameter/depth): 600 mm*290 mm\r\\n- S/S bowl and dough mixer arm.\r\\n- N.W.: 106 kg. Net m3 : 0.49\r\\n- dim : 646 x 955 x 794 mm.\r\\nHY.05.k / Empero - Capinox.\"', NULL, '<strong>DOUGH KNEADING MACHINE - HY.05.K</strong>\r\\nThe HY.05.K Dough Kneading Machine is a high-capacity, durable machine designed for efficient kneading of large quantities of dough. With a powerful motor and robust construction, it ensures smooth, consistent mixing, making it ideal for bakeries, pizzerias, and large-scale food production.', NULL, '\"<strong>DOUGH KNEADING MACHINE</strong>\r\\n- flour cap : 30 kg.\r\\n- capacity : 50 ltr.\r\\n- Motor Power:0.75 Kw 1400 rpm / 220V - 380V / 50-60 Hz\r\\n- Bowl dim(diameter/depth): 600 mm*290 mm\r\\n- S/S bowl and dough mixer arm.\r\\n- N.W.: 106 kg. Net m3 : 0.49\r\\n- dim : 646 x 955 x 794 mm.\r\\nHY.05.k / Empero - Capinox.\"', 4200.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 17, NULL, NULL, 16, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Bakery Mixers, BAKERY LINE', 'Bread Maker, Kitchen Equipment', 'HY.05.k', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:31', '2026-04-10 06:40:17', NULL, 0),
(4181, 'DOUGH KNEADING MACHINE - HY.07.k', NULL, 'dough-kneading-machine-hy07k-1', '\"<strong>DOUGH KNEADING MACHINE</strong>\r\\n- flour cap : 50 kg.\r\\n- capacity : 75 ltr.\r\\n- Motor Power: 1.10 kW 1400 rpm / 220V - 380V / 50-60 Hz\r\\n- Bowl dim(diameter/depth): 750 mm* 350 mm\r\\n- S/S bowl and dough mixer arm.\r\\n- N.W.: 140 kg. Net m3 : 0.78\r\\n- dim : 815 x 1130 x 882 mm.\r\\nHY.07.k / Empero - Capinox.\"', NULL, '<strong>DOUGH KNEADING MACHINE - HY.07.K</strong>\r\\nThe HY.07.K Dough Kneading Machine is designed for heavy-duty kneading, providing efficient mixing for various types of dough. With a sturdy build and powerful motor, it ensures consistent results, making it ideal for bakeries, pizza parlors, and large food establishments.', NULL, '\"<strong>DOUGH KNEADING MACHINE</strong>\r\\n- flour cap : 50 kg.\r\\n- capacity : 75 ltr.\r\\n- Motor Power: 1.10 kW 1400 rpm / 220V - 380V / 50-60 Hz\r\\n- Bowl dim(diameter/depth): 750 mm* 350 mm\r\\n- S/S bowl and dough mixer arm.\r\\n- N.W.: 140 kg. Net m3 : 0.78\r\\n- dim : 815 x 1130 x 882 mm.\r\\nHY.07.k / Empero - Capinox.\"', 5200.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 17, NULL, NULL, 16, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Bakery Mixers, BAKERY LINE', 'Bread Maker, Kitchen Equipment', 'HY.07.k', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:31', '2026-04-10 06:40:17', NULL, 0),
