(4183, 'SHAWARMA MACHINES, GAS (MOTOR AT BOTTOM) - EMP.DN.150-LPG', NULL, 'shawarma-machines,-gas-motor-at-bottom-empdn150-lpg-1', '<strong>SHAWARMA MACHINES, GAS (MOTOR AT BOTTOM)</strong>\r\\n- Cap: 3 burners\r\\n- Magnet safety valve.\r\\n- Sliding bottom housing of the spear provides shawarma meat to get closer to burner.\r\\n- Adjustable spear / Dual direction option.\r\\n- Hygienic and safe / Stainless steel body\r\\n- power voltage: 8.3 kw/ 220V-50-60 Hz\r\\n- weight: 30 kg. net m3: 0.40\r\\n- dim: 737 x 619 x 978 mm.\r\\nEMP.DN.150-LPG / Empero - Capinox\r\\n\"', NULL, '<strong>SHAWARMA MACHINES, GAS (MOTOR AT BOTTOM) - EMP.DN.150-LPG</strong>\r\\nThe EMP.DN.150-LPG gas shawarma machine features a bottom-mounted motor for stability and smooth operation. Designed for high-performance grilling, it offers even heat distribution for perfectly cooked shawarma every time. Ideal for commercial kitchens and food establishments requiring reliable, efficient equipment.', NULL, '<strong>SHAWARMA MACHINES, GAS (MOTOR AT BOTTOM)</strong>\r\\n- Cap: 3 burners\r\\n- Magnet safety valve.\r\\n- Sliding bottom housing of the spear provides shawarma meat to get closer to burner.\r\\n- Adjustable spear / Dual direction option.\r\\n- Hygienic and safe / Stainless steel body\r\\n- power voltage: 8.3 kw/ 220V-50-60 Hz\r\\n- weight: 30 kg. net m3: 0.40\r\\n- dim: 737 x 619 x 978 mm.\r\\nEMP.DN.150-LPG / Empero - Capinox\r\\n\"', 1914.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 17, 37, 42, 16, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Shawarma Machines', NULL, 'EMP.DN.150-LPG', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:31', '2026-04-18 14:51:34', NULL, 0),
(4184, 'LAMB OVEN - EMP.KFR.01', NULL, 'lamb-oven-empkfr01-2', '\"<strong>LAMB OVEN</strong>\r\\n- Working system with electrical resistance and gas burner at the same time.\r\\n- 2 pieces of 1.5 kW electrical resistances on the oven and gas burner heating system at the bottom.\r\\n- Adaptable LPG or NG - Magnet Safety valves.\r\\n- Piezo lighter ignition system.\r\\n- Easy to clean and hygienic. S/S Body.\r\\n- Gas Consumption (ng): 1.72 m3/h; (lpg): 1.29 kg/h\r\\n- Power: 16.5 kW / 50-60 Hz . Weight. : 165 kg. . Net m3: 1\r\\n- Dim: 1210 x 973 x 850 mm\r\\nEMP.KFR.01 / Empero - Capinox \"', NULL, '<strong>LAMB OVEN - EMP.KFR.01</strong>\r\\nThe EMP.KFR.01 Lamb Oven is a high-performance, durable oven designed for slow-cooking lamb to perfection. With efficient heat distribution and robust construction, it ensures tender and flavorful results. Perfect for Middle Eastern cuisine and commercial kitchens specializing in lamb dishes.', NULL, '\"<strong>LAMB OVEN</strong>\r\\n- Working system with electrical resistance and gas burner at the same time.\r\\n- 2 pieces of 1.5 kW electrical resistances on the oven and gas burner heating system at the bottom.\r\\n- Adaptable LPG or NG - Magnet Safety valves.\r\\n- Piezo lighter ignition system.\r\\n- Easy to clean and hygienic. S/S Body.\r\\n- Gas Consumption (ng): 1.72 m3/h; (lpg): 1.29 kg/h\r\\n- Power: 16.5 kW / 50-60 Hz . Weight. : 165 kg. . Net m3: 1\r\\n- Dim: 1210 x 973 x 850 mm\r\\nEMP.KFR.01 / Empero - Capinox \"', 8560.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, 16, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Combi Oven, COOKING LINE, Kitchen Equipment', NULL, 'EMP.KFR.01', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:31', '2026-04-16 09:12:26', NULL, 0),
(4185, 'LA MARZOCCO Linea Mini White R', NULL, 'la-marzocco-linea-mini-white-r-1', 'LA MARZOCCO Linea Mini White R\r\\n<strong>Weight</strong> 30 kg\r\\n<strong>Dimensions</strong> 45.3 Ã— 35.7 Ã— 37.7 cm\r\\n<strong>ABOUT BRAND:</strong> Since 1927, La Marzocco has been manufacturing high quality and state-of-the-art espresso machines. The company originated from Florence, Italy, and has become a leader in innovative brewing equipment. The company has helped shaped the specialty coffee of today and aided business owners in serving signature beverages. La Marzocco products and parts are made durable to keep these machines last for a long time. Also, their parts are replaceable and accessible to provide speedy repair. Dedicated to serving, restaurant, cafe owners, and the community by providing reliable equipment and supporting coffee farms around the world.', NULL, 'The design of the Linea Mini is based on the most iconic La Marzocco machine ever built, the Linea Classic. Loved by thousands of professional baristas, the Linea Classic truly helped launch the speciality coffee movement of the early 1990â€™s. With the Linea Mini, we hope to help you create an espresso revolution in your kitchen. Made in Italy.', NULL, 'LA MARZOCCO Linea Mini White R\r\\n<strong>Weight</strong> 30 kg\r\\n<strong>Dimensions</strong> 45.3 Ã— 35.7 Ã— 37.7 cm\r\\n<strong>ABOUT BRAND:</strong> Since 1927, La Marzocco has been manufacturing high quality and state-of-the-art espresso machines. The company originated from Florence, Italy, and has become a leader in innovative brewing equipment. The company has helped shaped the specialty coffee of today and aided business owners in serving signature beverages. La Marzocco products and parts are made durable to keep these machines last for a long time. Also, their parts are replaceable and accessible to provide speedy repair. Dedicated to serving, restaurant, cafe owners, and the community by providing reliable equipment and supporting coffee farms around the world.', 21000.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 101, 8, NULL, 32, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Coffee Machines, Kitchen Equipment', NULL, 'Linea Mini White R', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:31', '2026-04-10 07:12:04', NULL, 0),
