(4188, 'Cellulose particle filter - 1 box = 100 pcs - VITO 50 / 80', NULL, 'cellulose-particle-filter-1-box-=-100-pcs-vito-50-/-80-1', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Cellulose particle filter - 1 box = 100 pcs - VITO 50 / 80 </p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ VITO Particle filters</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ The VITO particle filters keep all particles that are filtered out of the oil by the frying oil filter machines.\r\\nThey are placed inside the unit and can be used for several filtration cycles.\r\\nThe filters are made of cellulose and are therefore biodegradable.</p>', NULL, '<strong>Cellulose Particle Filter (1 Box = 100 pcs) - VITO 50/80</strong>\r\\nEfficiently trap impurities with these high-quality cellulose particle filters, designed for use with VITO 50 and VITO 80 oil filtration systems. Each box contains 100 durable filters, ensuring superior performance and extended oil life in commercial kitchens.', NULL, '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0px;\">â€¢ Cellulose particle filter - 1 box = 100 pcs - VITO 50 / 80 </p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ VITO Particle filters</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-top: 0;\">â€¢ The VITO particle filters keep all particles that are filtered out of the oil by the frying oil filter machines.\r\\nThey are placed inside the unit and can be used for several filtration cycles.\r\\nThe filters are made of cellulose and are therefore biodegradable.</p>', 1300.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 17, 45, 49, 82, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', NULL, NULL, 'VITO 50 / 80 ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:32', '2026-04-18 14:51:34', NULL, 0),
