sion blender last longer.\r\\nWhisk metal gear box: gears contained within 2 separate metal casings which make the gearbox very strong and resistant under heavy processing.\r\\n<h4>Cleaning</h4>\r\\nMoulded whisks for optimal hygiene\r\\nThe bell and blade can be removed for easy cleaning, perfect hygiene and easy maintenance - an exclusive Robot Coupe patented system.', 4293.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 101, 8, NULL, 57, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Blenders, COFFEE & BAR LINE, Kitchen Equipment', NULL, 'MP450 COMBI ULTRA', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:32', '2026-04-10 07:12:04', NULL, 0),
