(4210, 'Hoshizaki Self-Contained Cuber (IM-30CNE-HC)â€“ 30 kg/Day, 11.5 kg -  IMâ€30CNEâ€HC  (M062', NULL, 'hoshizaki-self-contained-cuber-im-30cne-hc-30-kg/day,-115-kg-imâ€30cneâ€hc-m062-2', 'Hoshizaki Self-Contained Cuber (IM-30CNE-HC)â€“ 30 kg/Day, 11.5 kg - IMâ€30CNEâ€HC (M062\r\\n<strong>Specifications</strong>\r\\nItem Number: M062\r\\nProduct Title: Cuber / Self Contained\r\\nRefrigerant: R290\r\\nMaterial: Stainless steel\r\\nInstallation Type: Ready to Use\r\\nColling Style: Air Cooled\r\\nProduction Capacity (kg/24h): 30\r\\nStorage bin capacity (kg) approx.: 11.5\r\\nProduct configuration: Self Contained\r\\nIce Type: L Cube â€“ standard\r\\nElectric connection Load (kW): 0.23 kW\r\\nInput Voltage: 1/220 â€“ 240V/50Hz\r\\nPhase: Single Phase\r\\nHertz: 50 Hz\r\\nFuel Type: Electricity\r\\nNet weight (kg): 34 Kg\r\\nGross Weight Packed (kg): 39 Kg\r\\nDimensions W x D x H (mm): 398 x 451 x 695', NULL, '<a id=\"t44_95d4f334-8ea7-4cd2-b609-2373b1e848b8\" class=\"t4s-tab__title t4s-fwm t4s-ch\" href=\"https://mariotstore.com/\" data-t4s-tab-item=\"\" data-no-instant=\"\"><span class=\"t4s-tab__text\">Product Features</span></a>\r\\n<div id=\"t4s-tab-destemplate--23798762438967__main\" class=\"t4s-rte t4s-tab-content t4s-active\" data-t4s-tab-content=\"\">\r\\n<div class=\"main-collection-block-tab\">\r\\n<ul>\r\\n 	<li><strong>High Production Capacity:</strong>Â Produces 30 kg of crystal-clear ice daily to meet commercial needs.</li>\r\\n 	<li><strong>Compact Design:</strong>Â Space-saving, stainless steel construction for easy maintenance and durability.</li>\r\\n 	<li><strong>Energy Efficient:Â </strong>Low power consumption (0.23 kW) with environmentally friendly R290 refrigerant.</li>\r\\n 	<li><strong>Ample Storage:Â </strong>Comes with an 11.5 kg ice bin for sufficient supply during peak hours.</li>\r\\n 	<li><strong>Clean Ice Quality:</strong>Â Closed-cell system ensures pure ice by using fresh water each cycle.</li>\r\\n 	<li><strong>Easy Maintenance:</strong>Â Convenient air filter thatâ€™s simple to clean and maintain.&amp;nbsp;\r\\nReliable Performance: Separate electronics system to ensure stable operation.</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<div class=\"main-overview-block-tab\">\r\\n<h2>Product Description</h2>\r\\n<div class=\"metafield-rich_text_field\">\r\\n\r\\nDesigned for high-demand environments, the Hoshizaki IM-30CNE-HC Ice Maker delivers up to 30 kg of clear, fresh L cube standard ice daily, making it ideal for cafes, bars, restaurants, and other commercial establishments.\r\\n\r\\nIts 11.5 kg self-contained bin provides ample space to meet demands during busy periods. The exterior is made from stainless steel to give the product durability, and it can also be easily cleaned to maintain long-lasting hygiene. This single-phase unit operates at 50 Hz, ensuring optimal performance in commercial settings.\r\\n\r\\nWith a frequency of 0.23 kW and 1/220â€“240V/50Hz input voltage, it comes with an environmentally friendly R290 refrigerant. The unit has dimensions of (W x D x H) 398 x 451 x 695, weighs 39 kg, and features height-adjustable legs. The closed cell system creates ice with purified water in each cycle, maintaining the water\'s purity and taste. The air-cooled system ensures efficient cooling of the ice. For any business seeking reliability, quality, and sustainability in ice production, the Hoshizaki IM-30CNE-HC Ice Maker is the right choice.\r\\n\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>', NULL, 'Hoshizaki Self-Contained Cuber (IM-30CNE-HC)â€“ 30 kg/Day, 11.5 kg - IMâ€30CNEâ€HC (M062\r\\n<strong>Specifications</strong>\r\\nItem Number: M062\r\\nProduct Title: Cuber / Self Contained\r\\nRefrigerant: R290\r\\nMaterial: Stainless steel\r\\nInstallation Type: Ready to Use\r\\nColling Style: Air Cooled\r\\nProduction Capacity (kg/24h): 30\r\\nStorage bin capacity (kg) approx.: 11.5\r\\nProduct configuration: Self Contained\r\\nIce Type: L Cube â€“ standard\r\\nElectric connection Load (kW): 0.23 kW\r\\nInput Voltage: 1/220 â€“ 240V/50Hz\r\\nPhase: Single Phase\r\\nHertz: 50 Hz\r\\nFuel Type: Electricity\r\\nNet weight (kg): 34 Kg\r\\nGross Weight Packed (kg): 39 Kg\r\\nDimensions W x D x H (mm): 398 x 451 x 695', 8768.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 13, 14, NULL, 89, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'ICE MAKER & FLAKES, Kitchen Equipment, REFRIGERATION LINE', NULL, 'IMâ€30CNEâ€HC (M062', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:32', '2026-04-10 07:12:04', NULL, 0),
(4211, 'Ice Cube Maker With Bin, Ice Capacity 46 kg/Day, 0.28 kW - IMâ€45CNEâ€HC (M065)', NULL, 'ice-cube-maker-with-bin,-ice-capacity-46-kg/day,-028-kw-imâ€45cneâ€hc-m065-2', '<strong>Ice Cube Maker With Bin, Ice Capacity 46 kg/Day, 0.28 kW - IMâ€45CNEâ€HC (M065)</strong>\r\\n<strong>Specifications</strong>\r\\nItem Number: IMâ€45CNEâ€HC (M065)\r\\nProduct Title:Cuber / Self Contained\r\\nRefrigerant:R290\r\\nMaterial:Stainless steel\r\\nInstallation Type:Ready to Use\r\\nColling Style:Air Cooled\r\\nProduction Capacity (kg/24h):39\r\\nStorage bin capacity (kg) approx.:15\r\\nProduct configuration:Self Contained\r\\nIce Type:L Cube â€“ standard\r\\nElectric connection Load (kW):0.275 kW\r\\nInput Voltage:1/220 â€“ 240V/50Hz\r\\nPhase:Single Phase\r\\nHertz:50 Hz\r\\nFuel Type:Electricity\r\\nNet weight (kg);34 Kg\r\\nGross Weight Packed (kg);39 Kg\r\\nDimensions W x D x H (mm):633 x 511 x 690', NULL, '<span class=\"t4s-tab__text\">Product Features</span>\r\\n<h5 class=\"serp-title\">Ice Cube Maker With Bin</h5>\r\\n<div id=\"t4s-tab-destemplate--23798762438967__main\" class=\"t4s-rte t4s-tab-content t4s-active\" data-t4s-tab-content=\"\">\r\\n<div class=\"main-collection-block-tab\">\r\\n<ul>\r\\n 	<li>Features a durable stainless steel exterior for enhanced hygiene and longevity.</li>\r\\n 	<li>Measuring W 63.3, D 51.1, H 69 cm, with adjustable legs for a perfect height.</li>\r\\n 	<li>Highly energy efficient operation because of 0.28 kW power rating.</li>\r\\n 	<li>Operates at single phase, 220 â€“ 240V/50Hz.</li>\r\\n 	<li>Capable of producing up to 46 kg of ice per day, meeting high-demand needs efficiently.</li>\r\\n 	<li>Offers a 15 kg self-contained bin for ample ice storage.</li>\r\\n 	<li>Includes an automatic rinse cycle to maintain ice purity and hygiene.</li>\r\\n 	<li>Composed of closed cell system with fresh water for every new ice batch.</li>\r\\n 	<li>Easy-to-clean air filter prolongs product life and reduces maintenance costs.</li>\r\\n 	<li>Utilizes an air cooling system for efficient heat removal.</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<div class=\"main-overview-block-tab\">\r\\n<h2>Product Description</h2>\r\\n<div class=\"metafield-rich_text_field\">\r\\n\r\\nThe Hoshizaki IM-45CNE-HC Ice Cube Maker With Bin, Ice Capacity 46 kg/Day, 0.28 kW is a top-tier solution for commercial ice needs, delivering outstanding performance and reliability. Designed for efficiency, it produces an impressive 46 kg of high-quality ice per 24 hours, making it ideal for busy environments such as restaurants, bars, and cafes.\r\\nIt features an 15 kg self-contained bin, providing ample storage to keep up with high-demand situations. Each ice cube measures 2.8 x 2.8 x 3.2 cm, ensuring a consistent and professional presentation that enhances the customer experience. The stainless steel construction not only offers a sleek, modern appearance but also ensures durability and easy maintenance.\r\\nThe air cooling system is its standout feature paired with R290 refrigerant, known for its energy efficiency and eco-friendly benefits. The machineâ€™s closed cell system uses fresh water for each new batch of ice, significantly reducing the risk of contamination and maintaining the purity of the ice. Additionally, the magnetic water pump eliminates direct coupling, which prevents leaks and adds to the machineâ€™s reliability.\r\\nThe electronically controlled system adjusts to varying conditions, ensuring a consistent ice-making process without the need for manual adjustments. Routine maintenance is simplified with the easily cleanable air filter, which extends the machine\'s lifespan and reduces maintenance costs.\r\\nWith its compact dimensions (W 63.3, D 51.1, H 69 cm) and adjustable legs, it fits seamlessly into various spaces. Weighing 45 kg and consuming just 0.28 kW of power, it combines durable performance with energy efficiency. For businesses seeking a reliable, high-capacity ice maker, this is the perfect choice.\r\\n\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>', NULL, '<strong>Ice Cube Maker With Bin, Ice Capacity 46 kg/Day, 0.28 kW - IMâ€45CNEâ€HC (M065)</strong>\r\\n<strong>Specifications</strong>\r\\nItem Number: IMâ€45CNEâ€HC (M065)\r\\nProduct Title:Cuber / Self Contained\r\\nRefrigerant:R290\r\\nMaterial:Stainless steel\r\\nInstallation Type:Ready to Use\r\\nColling Style:Air Cooled\r\\nProduction Capacity (kg/24h):39\r\\nStorage bin capacity (kg) approx.:15\r\\nProduct configuration:Self Contained\r\\nIce Type:L Cube â€“ standard\r\\nElectric connection Load (kW):0.275 kW\r\\nInput Voltage:1/220 â€“ 240V/50Hz\r\\nPhase:Single Phase\r\\nHertz:50 Hz\r\\nFuel Type:Electricity\r\\nNet weight (kg);34 Kg\r\\nGross Weight Packed (kg);39 Kg\r\\nDimensions W x D x H (mm):633 x 511 x 690', 10518.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 13, 14, NULL, 89, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'ICE MAKER & FLAKES, Kitchen Equipment, REFRIGERATION LINE', NULL, 'IMâ€45CNEâ€HC (M065)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:32', '2026-04-18 14:51:34', NULL, 0),
