e is 5 - 35Â°C.\r\\nAir-Cooled System: Easy to install since it does not require a water connection.\r\\nProduct Description\r\\nThe Hoshizaki IM-100CNE is an excellent solution for businesses that require high-volume ice manufacturing, making up to 105 kg ice (28 x 28 x 32 mm) per day. With a storage bin capacity of 38 kg, it can store a sufficient amount of ice for daily usage. Designed to generate clear, firm, L cube standard ice cube, it\'s ideal for high-traffic pubs, restaurants, and hotels. With dimensions of (W X D X H) 1004 x 600 x 800 and net weight of 77 Kg, this unit readily fits into narrow places and delivers great performance. The built-in bin ensures a constant ice supply, and the automatic cleaning feature makes maintenance hassle-free.\r\\n\r\\nWith 0.5 kW electric connection load, 0.63 kW electric connection load, and input voltage of 1/220-240V/50 Hz, this single-phase unit can produce 1.8 KG / 80 PCS per cycle. This modular, stackable designed unit works on R290 refrigerant and is made of tough stainless-steel exterior is sturdy and easy to clean, and the air-cooled condenser assures effective performance even in high ambient temperature of 1 - 40Â°C. The Hoshizaki IM- IM-100CNE is ideal for large commercial applications, providing the reliability and capacity required to fulfill high ice demand.', NULL, '<strong>Ice Cube Maker Self-Contained Hoshizaki - 105kg/Day - IMâ€100CNEâ€HC (M068)</strong>\r\\n<strong>Specifications</strong>\r\\nProduct Title:Self-contained\r\\nRefrigerant:R290\r\\nMaterial:Stainless steel\r\\nInstallation Type:Ready to Use\r\\nColling Style:Air Cooled\r\\nProduction Capacity (kg/24h):105\r\\nStorage bin capacity (kg) approx.:38 kg\r\\nProduct configuration:Self Contained\r\\nHeat Rejection:(AT 32ËšC - WT 21ËšC) 1150W\r\\nAmbient Temperature:1 - 40Â°C\r\\nWater Supply Pressure:0.7-8bar (0.07-0.8MPa)\r\\nWater Supply Temperature:5 - 35Â°C\r\\nIce Production (PER CYCLE):1.8 KG / 80 PCS\r\\nCube Dimension:28 x 28 x 32 mm\r\\nElectric connection Load (kW):0.63 kW\r\\nInput Voltage:1/220-240V/50 Hz\r\\nPhase:Single Phase\r\\nHertz:50 Hz\r\\nContains:Scoop and Installation Kit\r\\nFuel Type:Electricity\r\\nNet weight (kg):77 Kg\r\\nGross Weight Packed (kg):88kg\r\\nDimensions W x D x H (mm):1004 x 600 x 800 (Legs add 100 mm)\r\\nPackaging Dimensions:W 1110 X D 600 X H 840', 16093.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 13, 14, NULL, 89, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'ICE MAKER & FLAKES, Kitchen Equipment, REFRIGERATION LINE', NULL, 'IMâ€100CNEâ€HC  (M068)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:32', '2026-04-18 14:51:34', NULL, 0),
(4216, 'Ice Maker Modular & Stackable Cube â€ (210Kgs/24h) Hoshizaki- IMâ€240XNEâ€HC  (M071â€D101 )', NULL, 'ice-maker-modular-and-stackable-cube-â€-210kgs/24h-hoshizaki-imâ€240xneâ€hc-m071â€d101-2', '<strong>Ice Maker Modular &amp; Stackable Cube â€ (210Kgs/24h) Hoshizaki- IMâ€240XNEâ€HC (M071â€D101 )</strong>\r\\nProduction Capacity per 24hours Approx. 205kg @ 21Â°C Air temp; 15Â°C Water\r\\nApprox. 160kg @ 32Â°C Air temp; 21Â°C Water\r\\nMax Storage Capacity Select Bin &amp; Kit\r\\nFreeze Cycle Time Approx. 19 Min\r\\nIce Production Per cycle Approx. 3.2kg/140pcs\r\\nWidth 1084mm\r\\nDepth 700mm\r\\nHeight 500mm\r\\nWeight Net 84kg\r\\nPacked Weight 98kg\r\\nCooling Air\r\\nAC Supply Voltage 1 PHASE 220-240V 50Hz/ 10 AMP Plug\r\\nAmperage Running: 6.6A\r\\nRefrigerant Charge R404A / 480g\r\\nOperating Conditions Ambient Temp.: 1-40Â°C\r\\nWater Supply Temp.: 5-35Â°C\r\\nWater Supply Pressure: 0.07-0.8MPa (0.7-8bar) Voltage\r\\nRange: Rated Voltage Â±6%\r\\n\r\\n<strong>FEATURES</strong>\r\\nNew intelligent control circuit dedicated to saving power and water consumption.\r\\nProduces individually made cubes which are crystal-clear and slow melting.\r\\nUnique closed cell water circuit for ultimate contamination protection.\r\\nAuto rinse and flush cycle.\r\\nMicro computer controller controls ice making process to work at peak performance in any conditions.\r\\nEasily removable and cleanable air filters on front panel.\r\\nInbuilt safety features â€“ freeze cycle back up timer, defrost back up, low voltage and high amp protector.\r\\nDurable stainless-steel exterior.\r\\nCan be stacked and combined with modular bins and bases\r\\nSmart plug-and-play design comes complete with ice chute for an easy and quick setup', NULL, '<strong>Ice Maker Modular &amp; Stackable Cube â€ (210Kgs/24h) Hoshizaki- IMâ€240XNEâ€HC (M071â€D101 )</strong>\r\\nThe Hoshizaki IM-240XNE is a cube ice maker that can be stacked, capable of producing an impressive 205 kg of premium cube ice within a 24-hour timeframe.\r\\n\r\\nEach Cuber model comes with an integrated electronic control system, guaranteeing an efficient ice production process even when conditions change. With this automated system in place, our Cubers consistently generate substantial quantities of high-grade ice cubes without the need for additional manual intervention or adjustments.', NULL, '<strong>Ice Maker Modular &amp; Stackable Cube â€ (210Kgs/24h) Hoshizaki- IMâ€240XNEâ€HC (M071â€D101 )</strong>\r\\nProduction Capacity per 24hours Approx. 205kg @ 21Â°C Air temp; 15Â°C Water\r\\nApprox. 160kg @ 32Â°C Air temp; 21Â°C Water\r\\nMax Storage Capacity Select Bin &amp; Kit\r\\nFreeze Cycle Time Approx. 19 Min\r\\nIce Production Per cycle Approx. 3.2kg/140pcs\r\\nWidth 1084mm\r\\nDepth 700mm\r\\nHeight 500mm\r\\nWeight Net 84kg\r\\nPacked Weight 98kg\r\\nCooling Air\r\\nAC Supply Voltage 1 PHASE 220-240V 50Hz/ 10 AMP Plug\r\\nAmperage Running: 6.6A\r\\nRefrigerant Charge R404A / 480g\r\\nOperating Conditions Ambient Temp.: 1-40Â°C\r\\nWater Supply Temp.: 5-35Â°C\r\\nWater Supply Pressure: 0.07-0.8MPa (0.7-8bar) Voltage\r\\nRange: Rated Voltage Â±6%\r\\n\r\\n<strong>FEATURES</strong>\r\\nNew intelligent control circuit dedicated to saving power and water consumption.\r\\nProduces individually made cubes which are crystal-clear and slow melting.\r\\nUnique closed cell water circuit for ultimate contamination protection.\r\\nAuto rinse and flush cycle.\r\\nMicro computer controller controls ice making process to work at peak performance in any conditions.\r\\nEasily removable and cleanable air filters on front panel.\r\\nInbuilt safety features â€“ freeze cycle back up timer, defrost back up, low voltage and high amp protector.\r\\nDurable stainless-steel exterior.\r\\nCan be stacked and combined with modular bins and bases\r\\nSmart plug-and-play design comes complete with ice chute for an easy and quick setup', 22610.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 13, 14, NULL, 89, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'ICE MAKER & FLAKES, Kitchen Equipment, REFRIGERATION LINE', NULL, 'IMâ€240XNEâ€HC  (M071â€D101 )', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:32', '2026-04-18 14:51:34', NULL, 0),
(4217, 'Self Contained Hydrocarbon Ice Flaker (85kg/24hr) Hoshizaki - FMâ€80KEâ€HC (F114)', NULL, 'self-contained-hydrocarbon-ice-flaker-85kg/24hr-hoshizaki-fmâ€80keâ€hc-f114-2', '<strong>Self Contained Hydrocarbon Ice Flaker (85kg/24hr) Hoshizaki - FMâ€80KEâ€HC (F114)</strong>\r\\nConsists of 70% ice &amp; 30% water\r\\nIdeal for cooling purposes such as to cool, transport &amp; hold fish\r\\nProduction capacity: 85kg/24hr\r\\nStorage capacity: 26 KG\r\\nDimensions: 640(W) x 600(D) x 800(H)mm - (Legs 89 mm)\r\\nElectrical supply: 230V\r\\nElectrical capacity: 0.270 KW\r\\nRefrigerant: R290\r\\nWeight: 65 KG\r\\nPlease note this machine uses a gravity drain\r\\nAll Stands are 605mm high except the STIM-240M which is 355mm\r\\n4HC-H offer filtration and scale reduction\r\\nScalesticks offer scale reduction only\r\\n4HC-H filters are recommended for general use. Capacity: 79,485 litres per cartridge\r\\nCondensate pumps are supplied with 3 amp fused plug (not fitted) &amp; 2 metre reinforced drain hose', NULL, 'This Hoshizaki FM-80KE-HC is a self contained flake ice maker producing up to 85 kg of high-quality flake ice per 24 hours.\r\\n\r\\nHoshizaki ice makers generate quality granular ice, such as Flake ice. The light texture of granular ice has a quick cooling effect, creating an environment of uniform temperatures, without causing unpleasant freezer burn. This is why Hoshizaki Flake ice is highly popular and considered the ideal material to prepare and layer attractive food displays. For flake ice, the extruding head is equipped with wide channels and multi-blade cutters.', NULL, '<strong>Self Contained Hydrocarbon Ice Flaker (85kg/24hr) Hoshizaki - FMâ€80KEâ€HC (F114)</strong>\r\\nConsists of 70% ice &amp; 30% water\r\\nIdeal for cooling purposes such as to cool, transport &amp; hold fish\r\\nProduction capacity: 85kg/24hr\r\\nStorage capacity: 26 KG\r\\nDimensions: 640(W) x 600(D) x 800(H)mm - (Legs 89 mm)\r\\nElectrical supply: 230V\r\\nElectrical capacity: 0.270 KW\r\\nRefrigerant: R290\r\\nWeight: 65 KG\r\\nPlease note this machine uses a gravity drain\r\\nAll Stands are 605mm high except the STIM-240M which is 355mm\r\\n4HC-H offer filtration and scale reduction\r\\nScalesticks offer scale reduction only\r\\n4HC-H filters are recommended for general use. Capacity: 79,485 litres per cartridge\r\\nCondensate pumps are supplied with 3 amp fused plug (not fitted) &amp; 2 metre reinforced drain hose', 16898.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 13, 15, NULL, 89, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'ICE MAKER & FLAKES, Kitchen Equipment, REFRIGERATION LINE', NULL, 'FMâ€80KEâ€HC (F114)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:32', '2026-04-18 14:51:34', NULL, 0),
(4218, 'Ice Flaker Self Contained Hydrocarbon  (125kg/24hr) Hoshizaki FMâ€120KEâ€HC (F115)', NULL, 'ice-flaker-self-contained-hydrocarbon-125kg/24hr-hoshizaki-fmâ€120keâ€hc-f115-2', '<strong>Ice Flaker Self Contained Hydrocarbon (125kg/24hr) Hoshizaki FMâ€120KEâ€HC (F115)</strong>\r\\n<ul>\r\\n 	<li>125kg/24hr Production Capacity (Flake Ice)</li>\r\\n 	<li>110kg/24hr Production Capacity (Nugget Ice)</li>\r\\n 	<li>26kg Storage Capacity (Flake Ice) / 32kg Storage Capacity (Nugget Ice)</li>\r\\n 	<li>Electronically Controlled</li>\r\\n 	<li>Automatic Flush System</li>\r\\n 	<li>Closed Water Circuit</li>\r\\n 	<li>Electronically Controlled</li>\r\\n 	<li><strong>Dimensions:</strong>\r\\nW640mm x D600mm x H800mm (Legs add 89mm)</li>\r\\n 	<li>Features:\r\\nâ€¢ Produces either Flake or Nugget (-N) ice.\r\\nâ€¢ Member of the Emerald Class, Hoshizakiâ€™s range of climate friendly ice makers.\r\\nâ€¢ Can produce up to 125 kg of ice (flake) and 110 kg (nugget) per 24 hours (AT.10Â°C.WT.10Â°C).\r\\nâ€¢ Automatic flush system to reduce sediment build up.\r\\nâ€¢ Closed water circuit offers the ultimate contamination protection, by reducing the number of points at which impurities can enter the ice making process.\r\\nâ€¢ Electronically controlled to ensure an optimized ice making process under varying circumstances without the need for physical adjustments. Quality of ice is always consistent.\r\\nâ€¢ Easily cleanable air filter allows end-users to carry out routine cleaning schedules. Extends product life expectancy and reduces the frequency and costs of maintenance call-outs.\r\\nâ€¢ Stainless steel exterior with integrated door handles provides a hygienic and high quality finish.Specs:\r\\nâ€¢ Production Capacity (kg/24hr) Approx: 125(F) / 110(N)\r\\nâ€¢ Storage Bin Capacity (kg) Approx: 26(F) / 32(N)\r\\nâ€¢ Refrigerant: R290\r\\nâ€¢ Air Cooled</li>\r\\n</ul>', NULL, '<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\">\r\\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words text-start [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"d57709d6-be12-478e-8ce5-846f919e94b6\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\">\r\\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\r\\n<div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark\">\r\\n\r\\n<strong>Hoshizaki FM-120KE-HC (F115) Ice Flaker</strong> is a self-contained hydrocarbon ice maker that produces up to <strong>125kg of flake ice per 24 hours</strong>. Designed for efficiency and sustainability, it features an eco-friendly refrigerant, durable stainless steel construction, and advanced cooling technology, making it ideal for food preservation, healthcare, and beverage applications\r\\n\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>', NULL, '<strong>Ice Flaker Self Contained Hydrocarbon (125kg/24hr) Hoshizaki FMâ€120KEâ€HC (F115)</strong>\r\\n<ul>\r\\n 	<li>125kg/24hr Production Capacity (Flake Ice)</li>\r\\n 	<li>110kg/24hr Production Capacity (Nugget Ice)</li>\r\\n 	<li>26kg Storage Capacity (Flake Ice) / 32kg Storage Capacity (Nugget Ice)</li>\r\\n 	<li>Electronically Controlled</li>\r\\n 	<li>Automatic Flush System</li>\r\\n 	<li>Closed Water Circuit</li>\r\\n 	<li>Electronically Controlled</li>\r\\n 	<li><strong>Dimensions:</strong>\r\\nW640mm x D600mm x H800mm (Legs add 89mm)</li>\r\\n 	<li>Features:\r\\nâ€¢ Produces either Flake or Nugget (-N) ice.\r\\nâ€¢ Member of the Emerald Class, Hoshizakiâ€™s range of climate friendly ice makers.\r\\nâ€¢ Can produce up to 125 kg of ice (flake) and 110 kg (nugget) per 24 hours (AT.10Â°C.WT.10Â°C).\r\\nâ€¢ Automatic flush system to reduce sediment build up.\r\\nâ€¢ Closed water circuit offers the ultimate contamination protection, by reducing the number of points at which impurities can enter the ice making process.\r\\nâ€¢ Electronically controlled to ensure an optimized ice making process under varying circumstances without the need for physical adjustments. Quality of ice is always consistent.\r\\nâ€¢ Easily cleanable air filter allows end-users to carry out routine cleaning schedules. Extends product life expectancy and reduces the frequency and costs of maintenance call-outs.\r\\nâ€¢ Stainless steel exterior with integrated door handles provides a hygienic and high quality finish.Specs:\r\\nâ€¢ Production Capacity (kg/24hr) Approx: 125(F) / 110(N)\r\\nâ€¢ Storage Bin Capacity (kg) Approx: 26(F) / 32(N)\r\\nâ€¢ Refrigerant: R290\r\\nâ€¢ Air Cooled</li>\r\\n</ul>', 17780.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 13, 15, NULL, 89, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'ICE MAKER & FLAKES, Kitchen Equipment, REFRIGERATION LINE', NULL, 'FMâ€120KEâ€HC (F115)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:32', '2026-04-18 14:51:34', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `name`, `name_ar`, `slug`, `description`, `description_ar`, `short_description`, `short_description_ar`, `specifications`, `price`, `discount_percentage`, `offer_price`, `stock_quantity`, `track_inventory`, `category_id`, `sub_category_id`, `sub_sub_category_id`, `brand_id`, `seller_id`, `is_featured`, `is_weekly_deal`, `is_limited_offer`, `is_daily_offer`, `is_best_seller`, `status`, `product_group`, `sub_category`, `model`, `youtube_video_link`, `resources`, `offer_start`, `offer_end`, `is_active`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `frequently_bought_together`, `has_variants`) VALUES
(4219, 'Ice Flaker Modular , (150kg/24hrs) Hoshizaki- FMâ€150AKEâ€HCâ€SB (F128â€C101)', NULL, 'ice-flaker-modular-,-150kg/24hrs-hoshizaki-fmâ€150akeâ€hcâ€sb-f128â€c101-2', '<strong>Ice Flaker Modular , (150kg/24hrs) Hoshizaki- FMâ€150AKEâ€HCâ€SB (F128â€C101)</strong>\r\\n<table>\r\\n<tbody>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Model name</th>\r\\n<td>FM-150AKE-HC-SB</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Item Number</th>\r\\n<td>F128-C101</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Product Title</th>\r\\n<td>Flaker, Modular, HC</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Market Segment</th>\r\\n<td>Catering, Education, Food Processing, Hospitality, Laboratory</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Production Capacity (KG/24H) approx.</th>\r\\n<td>150</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Electric Connection Load (kW)</th>\r\\n<td>0.405</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Electric Connection</th>\r\\n<td>1/220 â€“ 240V/50Hz</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Outside Dimensions W x D x H (mm)</th>\r\\n<td>560 x 700 x 780</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Ice Type</th>\r\\n<td>Flake</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Refrigerant</th>\r\\n<td>R290</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Cooling System</th>\r\\n<td>Air Cooled</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Product Configuration</th>\r\\n<td>Modular</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Net Weight (kg)</th>\r\\n<td>63</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Gross Weight Packed (kg)</th>\r\\n<td>70</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Corresponding bin(s)</th>\r\\n<td>B-301SA, B-501SA, B-801SA</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>\r\\n<ul>\r\\n 	<li>Efficient ice making process due to Hoshizakiâ€™s unique FM auger system.</li>\r\\n 	<li>Utilises all water brought into the machine; therefore water consumption is equal to ice production.</li>\r\\n 	<li>Auger is made of double hardened stainless steel. Combined with carbon bearings, they work optimally in a tough and wet environment. Benefits include: longer product life expectancy and reduced maintenance costs.</li>\r\\n 	<li>Hoshizaki ice makers are micro computer controlled, controlling the ice making process to perform at its best under varying circumstances, without having to make physical adjustments.</li>\r\\n 	<li>Quality stainless steel auger and evaporator increase the life expectancy of these components and the whole ice maker, as well as reducing costly maintenance visits.</li>\r\\n 	<li>An easily cleanable air filter allows end users to carry out a routine cleaning schedule, extending product life expectancy and reducing the frequency and costs of maintenance call-outs.</li>\r\\n</ul>', NULL, '<h4 class=\"g-color-black g-font-weight-500\">FM-150AKE-HC-SB FLAKER, MODULAR, HC</h4>\r\\n<div class=\"g-cutter03\"></div>\r\\nThis modular ice maker uses Natural Refrigerant R290, which is environmentally friendly and energy efficient. It produces flake ice, which is often used for produce display of fish, fresh food and bottled beverages. In the medical field, flake ice is also used for organ transportation. Utilizing the most efficient ice making process due to the unique auger system, the water consumption is equal to the ice production. The main characteristic of Hoshizakiâ€™s flake ice is that â€˜freeze-burnâ€™ is prevented when displaying fresh fish or produce. This model has a stainless steel bottom and is configured with our storage bins.', NULL, '<strong>Ice Flaker Modular , (150kg/24hrs) Hoshizaki- FMâ€150AKEâ€HCâ€SB (F128â€C101)</strong>\r\\n<table>\r\\n<tbody>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Model name</th>\r\\n<td>FM-150AKE-HC-SB</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Item Number</th>\r\\n<td>F128-C101</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Product Title</th>\r\\n<td>Flaker, Modular, HC</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Market Segment</th>\r\\n<td>Catering, Education, Food Processing, Hospitality, Laboratory</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Production Capacity (KG/24H) approx.</th>\r\\n<td>150</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Electric Connection Load (kW)</th>\r\\n<td>0.405</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Electric Connection</th>\r\\n<td>1/220 â€“ 240V/50Hz</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Outside Dimensions W x D x H (mm)</th>\r\\n<td>560 x 700 x 780</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Ice Type</th>\r\\n<td>Flake</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Refrigerant</th>\r\\n<td>R290</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Cooling System</th>\r\\n<td>Air Cooled</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Product Configuration</th>\r\\n<td>Modular</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Net Weight (kg)</th>\r\\n<td>63</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Gross Weight Packed (kg)</th>\r\\n<td>70</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Corresponding bin(s)</th>\r\\n<td>B-301SA, B-501SA, B-801SA</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>\r\\n<ul>\r\\n 	<li>Efficient ice making process due to Hoshizakiâ€™s unique FM auger system.</li>\r\\n 	<li>Utilises all water brought into the machine; therefore water consumption is equal to ice production.</li>\r\\n 	<li>Auger is made of double hardened stainless steel. Combined with carbon bearings, they work optimally in a tough and wet environment. Benefits include: longer product life expectancy and reduced maintenance costs.</li>\r\\n 	<li>Hoshizaki ice makers are micro computer controlled, controlling the ice making process to perform at its best under varying circumstances, without having to make physical adjustments.</li>\r\\n 	<li>Quality stainless steel auger and evaporator increase the life expectancy of these components and the whole ice maker, as well as reducing costly maintenance visits.</li>\r\\n 	<li>An easily cleanable air filter allows end users to carry out a routine cleaning schedule, extending product life expectancy and reducing the frequency and costs of maintenance call-outs.</li>\r\\n</ul>', 17257.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 13, 15, NULL, 89, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'ICE MAKER & FLAKES, Kitchen Equipment, REFRIGERATION LINE', NULL, 'FMâ€150AKEâ€HCâ€SB (F128â€C101)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:32', '2026-04-18 14:51:34', NULL, 0),
(4220, 'Ice Maker Selfâ€Contained CubeÂ  (22kg/24h) Hoshizaki- IMâ€21CNEâ€HC (M061)', NULL, 'ice-maker-selfâ€contained-cube-22kg/24h-hoshizaki-imâ€21cneâ€hc-m061-2', '<strong>Ice Maker Selfâ€Contained CubeÂ  (22kg/24h) Hoshizaki- IMâ€21CNEâ€HC (M061)</strong>\r\\n\r\\n<strong>Hoshizaki IM-21CNE-HC Self Contained Cuber Ice Maker(Air cooled):</strong>\r\\n\r\\nThis Hoshizaki IM-21CNE-HC is a self-contained cube ice maker producing up to 25 kg of high-quality cube ice per 24 hours. Meeting even the strictest hygiene requirements, this true allrounder offers many application possibilities in segments including the foodservice and medical sector.\r\\n\r\\nAll Cubers are equipped with an electronic control system. This ensures an optimized ice-making process, even under varying circumstances. Without additional manual assistance or adjustments required, our Cubers produce generous amounts of ice cubes, at a consistently high quality.\r\\n\r\\nSustainable\r\\nThe IM-21CNE-HC uses refrigerant R290.\r\\nThis natural refrigerant is not only climate-friendly but also boosts the machine, when it comes to performance and production capacity.\r\\n\r\\nMaterial\r\\nThe exterior is made of stainless steel. The closed water circuit provides maximum protection against any type of contamination during the entire cubing process. All Hoshizaki machines are easy to use, clean, and maintain.\r\\n\r\\nUnique Technology\r\\nA dedicated jet of fresh water is injected into each of the closed cells. Excess water leaves the closed cell through a set of outlets. The cell walls block the freezing waterâ€™s expansion from all sides while reaching down to -30Â°C during the cubing process. Thanks to the automatic rinse cycles, impurities such as minerals, are eliminated from the water resulting in the purest ice possible while your machine is protected from calcification and mineral build-up.\r\\n\r\\nSmart Design\r\\nLike all Hoshizaki Ice makers, the IM-21CNE-HC is designed to last and comes with smart design extras such as a magnetic water pump without direct coupling. This element prevents leakage from the water circuit and improves the life expectancy of the machine.\r\\n\r\\nPerfect Fit\r\\nWith outside dimensions W x D x H of mm, the IM-21CNE-HC is compact and is a perfect fit for small spaces.\r\\n\r\\nPlug&amp;Play\r\\nThe smart plug-and-play design guarantees an easy and quick set-up.\r\\n\r\\n<strong>Specifications:</strong>\r\\n<table class=\"shop_attributes\" width=\"684\">\r\\n<tbody>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Product series</th>\r\\n<td>IM</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Model name</th>\r\\n<td>IM-21CNE-HC</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Item number</th>\r\\n<td>M061</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Product title</th>\r\\n<td>Cuber, Self Contained</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Brand</th>\r\\n<td>Hoshizaki</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Production Capacity (kg/24h) approx. (AT 10Â°C, WT 10Â°C)</th>\r\\n<td>25</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Storage bin capacity (kg) approx.</th>\r\\n<td>11,5</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Power supply</th>\r\\n<td>1/220 â€“ 240V/50Hz</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Electric Consumption (kW)</th>\r\\n<td>0,225</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Heat Rejection (AT 32Â°C, WT 21Â°C) (kW)</th>\r\\n<td>0,51</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Ice type</th>\r\\n<td>Large cubes, Standard</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Ice cube size</th>\r\\n<td>L (28 x 28 x 32 mm)</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Refrigerant</th>\r\\n<td>R290</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>CO2 equivalent (kg)</th>\r\\n<td>0,165</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Cooling System</th>\r\\n<td>Air Cooled</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Product configuration</th>\r\\n<td>Self Contained</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Net weight (kg)</th>\r\\n<td>34</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Gross Weight Packed (kg)</th>\r\\n<td>39</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>\r\\n<table class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes shop_attributes\">\r\\n<tbody>\r\\n<tr class=\"woocommer