em--dimensions\">\r\\n<th class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__label\">Dimensions</th>\r\\n<td class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__value\">56 Ã— 70 Ã— 88 cm</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>', NULL, '<strong>Hoshizaki IM-130ANE-HC Ice Cube Maker:</strong>\r\\n\r\\nThis Hoshizaki IM-130ANE-HC is a modular cube ice maker producing up to 125 kg of high-quality cube ice per 24 hours. Meeting even the strictest hygiene requirements, this true allrounder offers many application possibilities in segments including the foodservice and medical sector.\r\\n\r\\nAll Cubers are equipped with an electronic control system. This ensures an optimized ice-making process, even under varying circumstances. Without additional manual assistance or adjustments required, our Cubers produce generous amounts of ice cubes, at a consistently high quality.\r\\n\r\\n<strong>Key Feature:</strong>\r\\n<ul>\r\\n 	<li>Sustainable\r\\nThe IM-130ANE-HC uses refrigerant R290. Â This natural refrigerant is not only climate-friendly but also boosts the machine, when it comes to performance and production capacity.\r\\nThe exterior is made of stainless steel. The closed water circuit provides maximum protection against any type of contamination during the entire cubing process. All Hoshizaki machines are easy to use, clean, and maintain.</li>\r\\n 	<li>Unique Technology\r\\nA dedicated jet of fresh water is injected into each of the closed cells. Excess water leaves the closed cell through a set of outlets. The cell walls block the freezing waterâ€™s expansion from all sides while reaching down to -30Â°C during the cubing process.\r\\nThanks to the automatic rinse cycles, impurities such as minerals, are eliminated from the water resulting in the purest ice possible while your machine is protected from calcification and mineral build-up.</li>\r\\n 	<li>Smart Design\r\\nLike all Hoshizaki Ice makers, the IM-130ANE-HC is designed to last and comes with smart design extras such as a magnetic water pump without direct coupling. This element prevents leakage from the water circuit and improves the life expectancy of the machine.</li>\r\\n 	<li>Perfect Fit\r\\nNeed to amp up your production capacity? The variable setups with modular bins and bases allow the user to mix and match depending on individual requirements and conditions. The dimensions of the IM-130ANE-HC are mm.</li>\r\\n 	<li>Plug&amp;Play\r\\nThe smart plug-and-play design guarantees an easy and quick set-up.</li>\r\\n</ul>', NULL, '<strong>Ice Cube Maker Modular (125Kgs/24h) Hoshizaki- IMâ€130ANEâ€HC (M037â€D100)</strong>\r\\n\r\\n<strong>Specifications:</strong>\r\\n<table class=\"shop_attributes\" width=\"461\">\r\\n<tbody>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Product series</th>\r\\n<td>IM</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Model name</th>\r\\n<td>IM-130ANE-HC</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Item number</th>\r\\n<td>M037-D100</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Product title</th>\r\\n<td>Cuber, Modular</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Production capacity (kg/24h) approx.</th>\r\\n<td>125</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Electric connection</th>\r\\n<td>1/220 â€“ 240V/50Hz</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Electric consumption (kW)</th>\r\\n<td>0.635</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Ice cube size</th>\r\\n<td>L (28 x 28 x 32mm)</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Ice type</th>\r\\n<td>L Cube â€“ standard</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Refrigerant</th>\r\\n<td>R290</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>CO2 equivalent (kg)</th>\r\\n<td>0.33</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Cooling system</th>\r\\n<td>Air Cooled</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Product configuration</th>\r\\n<td>Modular</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Net weight (kg)</th>\r\\n<td>68</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Gross Weight Packed (kg)</th>\r\\n<td>79</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Corresponding bin(s)</th>\r\\n<td>B-140SA, B-210SA, B-340SA</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>\r\\n<table class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes shop_attributes\">\r\\n<tbody>\r\\n<tr class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item woocommerce-product-attributes-item--weight\">\r\\n<th class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__label\">Weight</th>\r\\n<td class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__value\">79 kg</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item woocommerce-product-attributes-item--dimensions\">\r\\n<th class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__label\">Dimensions</th>\r\\n<td class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__value\">56 Ã— 70 Ã— 88 cm</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>', 17472.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 13, 14, NULL, 89, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'ICE MAKER & FLAKES, Kitchen Equipment, REFRIGERATION LINE', NULL, 'IMâ€130ANEâ€HC (M037â€D100)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:32', '2026-04-18 14:51:34', NULL, 0),
