td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item woocommerce-product-attributes-item--dimensions\">\r\\n<th class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__label\">Dimensions</th>\r\\n<td class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__value\">108 Ã— 70 Ã— 50 cm</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item woocommerce-product-attributes-item--attribute_pa_units-per-box\">\r\\n<th class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__label\">Units per box</th>\r\\n<td class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__value\"><a href=\"https://www.muddle-me.com/units-per-box/1/\" rel=\"tag\">1</a></td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>', NULL, '<strong>Hoshizaki IM-240DNE-HC Modular Stackable Cube Ice Maker:</strong>\r\\n\r\\nThis Hoshizaki IM-240DNE-HC is a stackable cube ice maker producing up to 210 kg of high-quality cube ice per 24 hours. Meeting even the strictest hygiene requirements, this true allrounder offers many application possibilities in segments including the foodservice and medical sector.\r\\n\r\\nAll Cubers are equipped with an electronic control system. This ensures an optimized ice-making process, even under varying circumstances. Without additional manual assistance or adjustments required, our Cubers produce generous amounts of ice cubes, at a consistently high quality.\r\\n\r\\n<strong>Key Feature:</strong>\r\\n<ul>\r\\n 	<li>The IM-240DNE-HC uses refrigerant R290. Â This natural refrigerant is not only climate-friendly but also boosts the machine, when it comes to performance and production capacity.</li>\r\\n 	<li><strong>Material:Â </strong>The exterior is made of stainless steel. The closed water circuit provides maximum protection against any type of contamination during the entire cubing process. All Hoshizaki machines are easy to use, clean, and maintain.</li>\r\\n 	<li><strong>Unique Technology:Â </strong>A dedicated jet of fresh water is injected into each of the closed cells. Excess water leaves the closed cell through a set of outlets. The cell walls block the freezing waterâ€™s expansion from all sides while reaching down to -30Â°C during the cubing process. Thanks to the automatic rinse cycles, impurities such as minerals, are eliminated from the water resulting in the purest ice possible while your machine is protected from calcification and mineral build-up.</li>\r\\n 	<li><strong>Smart Design:Â </strong>Like all Hoshizaki Ice makers, the IM-240DNE-HC is designed to last and comes with smart design extras such as a magnetic water pump without direct coupling. This element prevents leakage from the water circuit and improves the life expectancy of the machine</li>\r\\n 	<li><strong>Perfect Fit:Â </strong>Need to amp up your production capacity? These ice makers can be stacked and combined with modular bins and bases. This allows the user to mix and match depending on individual requirements, ice consumption, and space conditions. The dimensions of the IM-240DNE-HC are 1084 x 700 x 500 mm.</li>\r\\n 	<li><strong>Plug &amp; Play:Â </strong>The smart plug-and-play design guarantees an easy and quick set-up.</li>\r\\n</ul>', NULL, '<strong>Ice Maker Modular &amp; Stackable Cube â€ (210Kgs/24h) Hoshizaki- IMâ€240DNEâ€HC (M071â€D100 )</strong>\r\\n\r\\n<strong>Specifications:</strong>\r\\n<table class=\"shop_attributes\">\r\\n<tbody>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Product series</th>\r\\n<td>IM</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Model name</th>\r\\n<td>IM-240DNE-HC</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Item number</th>\r\\n<td>M071-D100</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Product title</th>\r\\n<td>Cuber, Modular</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Production Capacity (kg/24h) approx. (AT 10Â°C, WT 10Â°C)</th>\r\\n<td>210</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Electric connection</th>\r\\n<td>1/220 â€“ 240V/50Hz</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Electric consumption (kW)</th>\r\\n<td>0.93</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Outside dimensions W x D x H (mm)</th>\r\\n<td>1084 x 700 x 500</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Ice type</th>\r\\n<td>L (28 x 28 x 32mm)</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Refrigerant</th>\r\\n<td>R290</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>CO2 equivalent (kg)</th>\r\\n<td>0.441</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Cooling system</th>\r\\n<td>Air Cooled</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Product configuration</th>\r\\n<td>Stackable</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Net weight (kg)</th>\r\\n<td>88</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Gross Weight Packed (kg)</th>\r\\n<td>96</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Corresponding bin(s)</th>\r\\n<td>B-340SA, F-1025-52S, F-650-44S, F-950-48S</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>\r\\n<table class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes shop_attributes\">\r\\n<tbody>\r\\n<tr class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item woocommerce-product-attributes-item--weight\">\r\\n<th class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__label\">Weight</th>\r\\n<td class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__value\">101 kg</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item woocommerce-product-attributes-item--dimensions\">\r\\n<th class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__label\">Dimensions</th>\r\\n<td class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__value\">108 Ã— 70 Ã— 50 cm</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item woocommerce-product-attributes-item--attribute_pa_units-per-box\">\r\\n<th class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__label\">Units per box</th>\r\\n<td class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__value\"><a href=\"https://www.muddle-me.com/units-per-box/1/\" rel=\"tag\">1</a></td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>', 22610.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 13, 14, NULL, 89, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'ICE MAKER & FLAKES, Kitchen Equipment, REFRIGERATION LINE', NULL, 'IMâ€240DNEâ€HC (M071â€D100 )', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:32', '2026-04-18 14:51:34', NULL, 0);
