(4225, 'Proofing Cabinet Salva- ARâ€22/93', NULL, 'proofing-cabinet-salva-arâ€22/93-1', '<strong>Proofing Cabinet Salva- ARâ€22/93</strong>\r\\nAR-22 Direct Proofing Cabinet for Trays\r\\nThe Salva AR-22 Direct Proofing Cabinet allows bakeries to streamline processes, enhance precision, and elevate standards.\r\\nQuicker Preparation\r\\nDirect fermentation eliminates the need for preparing a liquid culture, reducing the time and effort typically required for yeast preparation before fermentation.\r\\n\r\\nEnhanced Control\r\\nAdding yeast directly to the wort or mash enables precise fermentation control by adjusting yeast quantity and fermentation temperature, ensuring the desired flavour profile is achieved.\r\\n\r\\nMinimised Pollution\r\\nDirect fermentation mitigates contamination risks by bypassing yeast propagation in a liquid medium, protecting against bacteria or other microorganisms that may compromise the taste or quality of the end product.', NULL, '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c227e55 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c227e55\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\r\\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\\n\r\\nThe Salva\r\\n<h5 class=\"serp-title\">Proofing Cabinet Salva- ARâ€22/93</h5>\r\\nallows direct proofing for a variety of doughs on trays. With its independent control over steam and dry heat generation, the AR-22 features a robust power system that ensures optimal steam conditions and temperatures, allowing for precise proofing control and superior dough quality. With adjustable slides for 22 trays (between 60 x 40 and 80 x 46) the unit is constructed entirely of stainless steel plate and features four swivel castors on the base for effortless mobility. The AR-22 offers a robust and high-performance proofing solution for bakers, facilitating direct fermentation processes with efficiency and reliability.\r\\n\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<div class=\"elementor-e