iv class=\"elementor elementor-1693\" data-elementor-type=\"jet-listing-items\" data-elementor-id=\"1693\" data-elementor-post-type=\"jet-engine\"><section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-bce2115 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"bce2115\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\r\\n<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-custom\">\r\\n<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-9e49379\" data-id=\"9e49379\" data-element_type=\"column\">\r\\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\r\\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1dfbf9d elementor-widget elementor-widget-jet-listing-dynamic-field\" data-id=\"1dfbf9d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"jet-listing-dynamic-field.default\">\r\\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\\n<div class=\"jet-listing jet-listing-dynamic-field display-multiline\">\r\\n\r\\n&nbsp;\r\\n<div class=\"jet-listing-dynamic-field__content\">Two stainless steel heating units are located within the cabinet\'s base.</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</section></div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<div class=\"jet-listing-grid__item jet-listing-dynamic-post-28322\" data-post-id=\"28322\">\r\\n<div class=\"elementor elementor-1693\" data-elementor-type=\"jet-listing-items\" data-elementor-id=\"1693\" data-elementor-post-type=\"jet-engine\"><section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-bce2115 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"bce2115\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\r\\n<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-custom\">\r\\n<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-9e49379\" data-id=\"9e49379\" data-element_type=\"column\">\r\\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\r\\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1dfbf9d elementor-widget elementor-widget-jet-listing-dynamic-field\" data-id=\"1dfbf9d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"jet-listing-dynamic-field.default\">\r\\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\\n<div class=\"jet-listing jet-listing-dynamic-field display-multiline\">\r\\n\r\\n&nbsp;\r\\n<div class=\"jet-listing-dynamic-field__content\">Two adjustable thermostats ranging from 30Â°C to 90Â°C, each featuring controls and indicator lights for easy operation.</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</section></div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>', NULL, '<strong>Proofing Cabinet Salva- ARâ€22/93</strong>\r\\nAR-22 Direct Proofing Cabinet for Trays\r\\nThe Salva AR-22 Direct Proofing Cabinet allows bakeries to streamline processes, enhance precision, and elevate standards.\r\\nQuicker Preparation\r\\nDirect fermentation eliminates the need for preparing a liquid culture, reducing the time and effort typically required for yeast preparation before fermentation.\r\\n\r\\nEnhanced Control\r\\nAdding yeast directly to the wort or mash enables precise fermentation control by adjusting yeast quantity and fermentation temperature, ensuring the desired flavour profile is achieved.\r\\n\r\\nMinimised Pollution\r\\nDirect fermentation mitigates contamination risks by bypassing yeast propagation in a liquid medium, protecting against bacteria or other microorganisms that may compromise the taste or quality of the end product.', 21998.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 107, 111, NULL, 92, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', NULL, NULL, 'ARâ€22/93', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:32', '2026-04-18 14:51:34', NULL, 0),
(4226, 'VEGETABLE SLICER MACHINEÂ - PSP100', NULL, 'vegetable-slicer-machine-psp100-1', '<strong>VEGETABLE SLICER MACHINEÂ - PSP100</strong>\r\\nCapacity: 200/300 Kg\r\\nSpeed: 320 RPM\r\\nPower: 550 W, 230 V, 50 Hz\r\\nDim: 220x570x480 mm, 21 Kg\r\\nModel: PSP100, Miska, Made in Italy', NULL, 'The <strong data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"39\">PSP100 Vegetable Slicer Machine</strong> is a high-performance kitchen tool designed for precise and efficient slicing of various vegetables. Engineered for durability and ease of use, it features sharp stainless steel blades and adjustable cutting thickness, making it ideal for restaurants, catering businesses, and commercial kitchens. Streamline food prep and achieve consistent slices effortlessly with the PSP100.', NULL, '<strong>VEGETABLE SLICER MACHINEÂ - PSP100</strong>\r\\nCapacity: 200/300 Kg\r\\nSpeed: 320 RPM\r\\nPower: 550 W, 230 V, 50 Hz\r\\nDim: 220x570x480 mm, 21 Kg\r\\nModel: PSP100, Miska, Made in Italy', 2000.00, 0.00, NULL, 50, 0, 87, 97, 99, 44, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Vegtable Equipment', NULL, 'PSP100', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:32', '2026-04-18 14:51:34', NULL, 0),
