(4239, 'TurboChef Microwave Oven, Rapid /Touch controls, standard JET BLACK (RAL 9005) â€“ ECOâ€9500â€805/BLACK', NULL, 'turbochef-microwave-oven,-rapid-/touch-controls,-standard-jet-black-ral-9005-ecoâ€9500â€805/black-2', '<h1 class=\"product_title entry-title\">TurboChef Microwave Oven, Rapid /Touch controls, standard JET BLACK (RAL 9005) â€“ ECOâ€9500â€805/BLACK</h1>\r\\n<table class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes shop_attributes\">\r\\n<tbody>\r\\n<tr class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item woocommerce-product-attributes-item--weight\">\r\\n<th class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__label\">Weight</th>\r\\n<td class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__value\">54 kg</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item woocommerce-product-attributes-item--dimensions\">\r\\n<th class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__label\">Dimensions</th>\r\\n<td class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__value\">59.7 Ã— 40.9 Ã— 54.6 cm</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>\r\\n<ul class=\"tabs wc-tabs\">\r\\n 	<li class=\"woodmart_custom_tab_tab active\"><a href=\"https://yourkitchencenter.com/product/turbochef-microwave-oven-rapid-touch-controls-standard-jet-black-ral-9005-eco%e2%80%909500%e2%80%90817-uk/#tab-woodmart_custom_tab\">ABOUT THE BRAND</a></li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\nTurboChef Technologies, Inc. has pioneered the world of rapid cooking. With innovation and top performance in mind, TurboChef has redefined cooking efficiency by designing rapid-cook ovens that are versatile, user-friendly, and save energy. TurboChef ovens cook faster and produce consistent results without compromising quality.', NULL, 'The TurboChef ECO-9500 high-speed oven has customizable menu settings that can hold 256 recipes for quick use. These settings can be adjusted manually, with a USB drive, or on Wi-Fi for added cost. To ensure the unit operates efficiently, it self-diagnoses any potential problems. Due to its internal catalytic converter, the oven doesnâ€™t need a vent to eliminate grease and odor emissions, potentially saving operators significant capital. A single motor in the cabinet circulates air vertically to cook.\r\\n\r\\nCleaning the TurboChef ECO-9500 microwave convection oven is streamlined with one bottle of oven cleaner, one bottle of oven guard, two trigger sprayers, and an aluminum paddle. It comes with two aluminum pans and the oven rack is removable to accommodate various foods. The outer wrap and door are made of 430 stainless steel that remains cool to the touch to prevent burns. Because the cabinet is insulated, hot air doesnâ€™t escape while cooking.', NULL, '<h1 class=\"product_title entry-title\">TurboChef Microwave Oven, Rapid /Touch controls, standard JET BLACK (RAL 9005) â€“ ECOâ€9500â€805/BLACK</h1>\r\\n<table class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes shop_attributes\">\r\\n<tbody>\r\\n<tr class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item woocommerce-product-attributes-item--weight\">\r\\n<th class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__label\">Weight</th>\r\\n<td class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__value\">54 kg</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item woocommerce-product-attributes-item--dimensions\">\r\\n<th class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__label\">Dimensions</th>\r\\n<td class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__value\">59.7 Ã— 40.9 Ã— 54.6 cm</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>\r\\n<ul class=\"tabs wc-tabs\">\r\\n 	<li class=\"woodmart_custom_tab_tab active\"><a href=\"https://yourkitchencenter.com/product/turbochef-microwave-oven-rapid-touch-controls-standard-jet-black-ral-9005-eco%e2%80%909500%e2%80%90817-uk/#tab-woodmart_custom_tab\">ABOUT THE BRAND</a></li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\nTurboChef Technologies, Inc. has pioneered the world of rapid cooking. With innovation and top performance in mind, TurboChef has redefined cooking efficiency by designing rapid-cook ovens that are versatile, user-friendly, and save energy. TurboChef ovens cook faster and produce consistent results without compromising quality.', 28000.00, 15.00, 23800.00, 50, 0, 77, 80, NULL, 94, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', NULL, NULL, 'ECOâ€9500â€805/BLACK', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-17 22:17:32', '2026-04-18 14:51:34', NULL, 0),
